(1548286, 203646, 14773, '<td valign="top">love it...great work.  Good light and contrast. Just great. 8</td>', 'love it...great work.  Good light and contrast. Just great. 8', '2005-07-20 01:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548288, 203538, 30061, '<td valign="top">My eye was drawn to this in thumbnails, and I had to take a closer look.  Very nice shot.  Great color, love the shadows, and of course, great texture. Well done!</td>', 'My eye was drawn to this in thumbnails, and I had to take a closer look.  Very nice shot.  Great color, love the shadows, and of course, great texture. Well done!', '2005-07-20 01:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548305, 205730, 30061, '<td valign="top">This tree looks like the perfect spot to spend an afternoon reading.  Gorgeous all around.  The only thing I''m not sure of is the sky color - it seems to point out the somewhat harsh lighting.  But overall I think it adds a sort of fantasy touch to the whole shot, and I love it. :o)  Great shot!</td>', 'This tree looks like the perfect spot to spend an afternoon reading.  Gorgeous all around.  The only thing I''m not sure of is the sky color - it seems to point out the somewhat harsh lighting.  But overall I think it adds a sort of fantasy touch to the whole shot, and I love it. :o)  Great shot!', '2005-07-20 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548309, 206215, 5112, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is so beautiful!  Looks like a Dax to me :)  (Hope it is, otherwise I''ll be very embarrased.)  How did you do this?  10 from me.</td>', 'Oh, this is so beautiful!  Looks like a Dax to me :)  (Hope it is, otherwise I''ll be very embarrased.)  How did you do this?  10 from me.', '2005-07-20 01:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548323, 205547, 32767, '<td valign="top">Let''s Party!!!</td>', 'Let''s Party!!!', '2005-07-20 01:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548328, 204612, 30061, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like it.  The composition is great.  Constructive criticism - the color overall looks very real, but there''s nothing that really grabs your attention and says, "Look at me first!".  Aside from that, I love it.  Great job!</td>', 'Nice shot, I like it.  The composition is great.  Constructive criticism - the color overall looks very real, but there''s nothing that really grabs your attention and says, "Look at me first!".  Aside from that, I love it.  Great job!', '2005-07-20 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548340, 203986, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a great take on the challenge.  Were you in a helicopter???  WOW  Just a tad too bright in my eye, but still a supercapture.</td>', 'What a great take on the challenge.  Were you in a helicopter???  WOW  Just a tad too bright in my eye, but still a supercapture.', '2005-07-20 01:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548344, 205979, 37234, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting concept. I don''t particularly like the blown highlights on the bottom right side, but interesting, nonetheless. I should point out that 3+2=5, not 7.</td>', 'It''s an interesting concept. I don''t particularly like the blown highlights on the bottom right side, but interesting, nonetheless. I should point out that 3+2=5, not 7.', '2005-07-20 01:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548348, 206479, 30061, '<td valign="top">Points for creativity - this is one of the rare times I can say I''ve never seen a shot like this one before. AND you met the challenge!  What kind of amazing wonder-photographer are you, trying to show everyone else up? ;o)</td>', 'Points for creativity - this is one of the rare times I can say I''ve never seen a shot like this one before. AND you met the challenge!  What kind of amazing wonder-photographer are you, trying to show everyone else up? ;o)', '2005-07-20 01:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548349, 206152, 37234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I''m interested to find out where this was taken.</td>', 'Very pretty. I''m interested to find out where this was taken.', '2005-07-20 01:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548352, 205580, 37234, '<td valign="top">It''s really quite a well-taken photo, but I don''t understand the relation to "texture". Sorry if I''m slow and just not getting it!</td>', 'It''s really quite a well-taken photo, but I don''t understand the relation to "texture". Sorry if I''m slow and just not getting it!', '2005-07-20 01:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548355, 206227, 30061, '<td valign="top">As far as meeting the challenge, you did, but I can''t help but feel like the creativity/artistic vision is missing here...it definitely is more of a snapshot.</td>', 'As far as meeting the challenge, you did, but I can''t help but feel like the creativity/artistic vision is missing here...it definitely is more of a snapshot.', '2005-07-20 01:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548359, 206086, 259, '<td valign="top">hmm, yep, a 10.</td>', 'hmm, yep, a 10.', '2005-07-20 01:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548360, 205235, 37234, '<td valign="top">Very "textury", to create a word! I''m not a fan of  the frame, or the cropping (everything centered, plus the distracting stuff in bottom left corner).</td>', 'Very "textury", to create a word! I''m not a fan of  the frame, or the cropping (everything centered, plus the distracting stuff in bottom left corner).', '2005-07-20 01:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548364, 205067, 37779, '<td valign="top">Love the vivid coloring- but the shallow DOF makes my eyes go crazy! I still like it though. :)</td>', 'Love the vivid coloring- but the shallow DOF makes my eyes go crazy! I still like it though. :)', '2005-07-20 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548365, 206575, 30061, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this really doesn''t work for me.  The whole shot is too blurred to make much out - I wouldn''t have had a clue what you were trying to convey were it not for the title, and even then I have to squint and look really hard to see it.  It''s just not clear enough.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this really doesn''t work for me.  The whole shot is too blurred to make much out - I wouldn''t have had a clue what you were trying to convey were it not for the title, and even then I have to squint and look really hard to see it.  It''s just not clear enough.', '2005-07-20 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548366, 206517, 31628, '<td valign="top">While grainy, still good composition and lighting</td>', 'While grainy, still good composition and lighting', '2005-07-20 01:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548367, 206498, 37234, '<td valign="top">This shot could have been made a little more interesting (and textured) with the use of some sharpening</td>', 'This shot could have been made a little more interesting (and textured) with the use of some sharpening', '2005-07-20 01:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548372, 204955, 15711, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for the description, I wouldn''t have known what it was. It does have great texture and the contrast is good.</td>', 'Had it not been for the description, I wouldn''t have known what it was. It does have great texture and the contrast is good.', '2005-07-20 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548373, 206041, 31628, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this displays texture according to the spirit of the description, but a very interesting photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Not sure if this displays texture according to the spirit of the description, but a very interesting photo nonetheless.', '2005-07-20 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548376, 203507, 37779, '<td valign="top">Love the drama of this one. Really good lines and focus also. Great submission.</td>', 'Love the drama of this one. Really good lines and focus also. Great submission.', '2005-07-20 01:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548377, 204556, 39375, '<td valign="top">This looks EXACTLY like my friends photo from the Circle challenge.</td>', 'This looks EXACTLY like my friends photo from the Circle challenge.', '2005-07-20 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548378, 206069, 37234, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! I think a little more DOF would have been nice, and I''m not really sold on the greenish cast, but interesting, nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice idea! I think a little more DOF would have been nice, and I''m not really sold on the greenish cast, but interesting, nonetheless.', '2005-07-20 01:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548380, 206273, 31628, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, you''re going to get a lot of OOF comments.  This one is no exception...</td>', 'Unfortunately, you''re going to get a lot of OOF comments.  This one is no exception...', '2005-07-20 01:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548382, 206333, 34192, '<td valign="top">Gave you a 7 but had to come back to change it to a 9.  Here''s my reasoning.  This was too easy for this challenge, falling right after the zoo challenge.  I thought of it myself (though I had an elephant butt - my protest, nevermind about that).  But as I clicked on the 7 I said wait a minute.  That''s is a great image outside the challenge.  Excellent lighting, focus, POV and composition.  Give it what it deserves!  So I changed your score to a 9.  Sorry about the long winded explanation.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Gave you a 7 but had to come back to change it to a 9.  Here''s my reasoning.  This was too easy for this challenge, falling right after the zoo challenge.  I thought of it myself (though I had an elephant butt - my protest, nevermind about that).  But as I clicked on the 7 I said wait a minute.  That''s is a great image outside the challenge.  Excellent lighting, focus, POV and composition.  Give it what it deserves!  So I changed your score to a 9.  Sorry about the long winded explanation.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 01:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548383, 205992, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the sheer petals.  Lovely composition and contrasting colors.  Stunning shot.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the sheer petals.  Lovely composition and contrasting colors.  Stunning shot.', '2005-07-20 01:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548384, 206051, 37234, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan o fthe huge shadow or the gray "thing" it''s sitting on. You might have included ONLY on the colored things (candies?) for a more striking picture.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan o fthe huge shadow or the gray "thing" it''s sitting on. You might have included ONLY on the colored things (candies?) for a more striking picture.', '2005-07-20 01:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548385, 203529, 31628, '<td valign="top">A close-up on those stems or pods could have potentially produced a much more interesting texture.</td>', 'A close-up on those stems or pods could have potentially produced a much more interesting texture.', '2005-07-20 01:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548386, 205889, 30061, '<td valign="top">Cute and creative.  I love the composition, and even though (on my screen) parts of it border on overexposed, it works.  My one complaint is that the sky is a little grainy, but even then I think, "Yeah, but it makes you focus on the braids, and look how cute!"  :o) High points!</td>', 'Cute and creative.  I love the composition, and even though (on my screen) parts of it border on overexposed, it works.  My one complaint is that the sky is a little grainy, but even then I think, "Yeah, but it makes you focus on the braids, and look how cute!"  :o) High points!', '2005-07-20 01:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548389, 206055, 31628, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential.  It needs more shadows to really bring out the light areas.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential.  It needs more shadows to really bring out the light areas.', '2005-07-20 01:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548390, 203623, 27421, '<td valign="top">Soft focus? 7</td>', 'Soft focus? 7', '2005-07-20 01:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548391, 206557, 37234, '<td valign="top">Funny! You really shouldn''t award yourself the "brown", though. It''s bad luck! A nice idea that woudl be nicer without the light glaring right smack in the middle.</td>', 'Funny! You really shouldn''t award yourself the "brown", though. It''s bad luck! A nice idea that woudl be nicer without the light glaring right smack in the middle.', '2005-07-20 01:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548397, 206401, 31628, '<td valign="top">Without context, this borders on abstract and may suffer in voting.  Very interesting lighting otherwise.</td>', 'Without context, this borders on abstract and may suffer in voting.  Very interesting lighting otherwise.', '2005-07-20 01:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548399, 206535, 30061, '<td valign="top">How cool is it that you can get an iceberg that close, that sharp, and that pretty?  Not very, I think, but then again I hate to be cold, so I''ll leave this kind of shot to you.  Seriously, this shot is wonderful - I love the gray, bleak background against the gorgeous blue of the iceberg.  Well done!</td>', 'How cool is it that you can get an iceberg that close, that sharp, and that pretty?  Not very, I think, but then again I hate to be cold, so I''ll leave this kind of shot to you.  Seriously, this shot is wonderful - I love the gray, bleak background against the gorgeous blue of the iceberg.  Well done!', '2005-07-20 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548400, 205339, 37234, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I like the slightly soft look and hope you don''t get voted down because of it (DPC voters do seem to like ultra sharp). I think a touch more DOF to bring all the strands into focus would be better.</td>', 'I really like this. I like the slightly soft look and hope you don''t get voted down because of it (DPC voters do seem to like ultra sharp). I think a touch more DOF to bring all the strands into focus would be better.', '2005-07-20 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548404, 206159, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting but it took the title to help me figure out what it was.  Maybe a touch more detail  and focus would help with this one.</td>', 'Interesting but it took the title to help me figure out what it was.  Maybe a touch more detail  and focus would help with this one.', '2005-07-20 01:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548405, 205449, 40855, '<td valign="top">The pic doesn''t reveal the textures of your subject very well. You should also avoid blown highlights, which in your case predominate the slice of bread, like the plague. They can really kill an otherwise good picture.</td>', 'The pic doesn''t reveal the textures of your subject very well. You should also avoid blown highlights, which in your case predominate the slice of bread, like the plague. They can really kill an otherwise good picture.', '2005-07-20 01:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548406, 205754, 19168, '<td valign="top">great show of texture, but there''s no composition to the photograph, 5</td>', 'great show of texture, but there''s no composition to the photograph, 5', '2005-07-20 01:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548407, 203846, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish this were larger.  Cactus have great texture, but this image is a tad too small to appreciate it.</td>', 'I wish this were larger.  Cactus have great texture, but this image is a tad too small to appreciate it.', '2005-07-20 01:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548408, 203565, 259, '<td valign="top">could have had better pop with more contrast</td>', 'could have had better pop with more contrast', '2005-07-20 01:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548409, 205623, 32409, '<td valign="top">Good textures, but the colors seem flat. It just seems like texture overload.</td>', 'Good textures, but the colors seem flat. It just seems like texture overload.', '2005-07-20 01:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548410, 205068, 37234, '<td valign="top">A really well taken photo of a really unattractive subject! I''m not trying to offend you, by the way. I think your photo is well-done. Nicely exposed. It''s just not really a terribly enticing mushroom ;-)</td>', 'A really well taken photo of a really unattractive subject! I''m not trying to offend you, by the way. I think your photo is well-done. Nicely exposed. It''s just not really a terribly enticing mushroom ;-)', '2005-07-20 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
