(1548760, 205675, 7570, '<td valign="top">i dont know why i cant rate this higher than average. it does meets the challenge, but i think its just that the subject of choice is quite creepy (i got something against creepy crawlies, sorry)</td>', 'i dont know why i cant rate this higher than average. it does meets the challenge, but i think its just that the subject of choice is quite creepy (i got something against creepy crawlies, sorry)', '2005-07-20 02:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548764, 205920, 40855, '<td valign="top">I just love your choice of subject. Faded velour couches definitely evoke a strong sense of nostalgia (at least for me). I think contrast is the main issue here. For example, is there a way that you could have emphasized the difference between the faded and not-so-faded partch of the fabric (perhaps more sharpening?). I really think you have a good image here but that it needs a little bit of a boost from post-processing.</td>', 'I just love your choice of subject. Faded velour couches definitely evoke a strong sense of nostalgia (at least for me). I think contrast is the main issue here. For example, is there a way that you could have emphasized the difference between the faded and not-so-faded partch of the fabric (perhaps more sharpening?). I really think you have a good image here but that it needs a little bit of a boost from post-processing.', '2005-07-20 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1548765, 206290, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is remarkable work. The extreme DOF and color drop-out is unbelievable.  Great textures.  10</td>', 'This is remarkable work. The extreme DOF and color drop-out is unbelievable.  Great textures.  10', '2005-07-20 02:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
