(1548977, 206546, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the DOF and colors.  Seems just a tad dark to me.  Perhaps adjusting the shadows/highlights and contrast a little would give it a little more dimension.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the DOF and colors.  Seems just a tad dark to me.  Perhaps adjusting the shadows/highlights and contrast a little would give it a little more dimension.', '2005-07-20 02:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
