(1549054, 205328, 37893, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re trying to do here and I think it''s the texture of thr froth you''re trying to convey. It would probably be best if you came in tighter within the frame so that the distracting background is out of focus or even non-existent. It''s a 50/50 split between your background and your subject so the value for both is a bit over saturated. I can almost feel the froth of the milk but it''s just a little too far from my reach. Great try though.</td>', 'I see what you''re trying to do here and I think it''s the texture of thr froth you''re trying to convey. It would probably be best if you came in tighter within the frame so that the distracting background is out of focus or even non-existent. It''s a 50/50 split between your background and your subject so the value for both is a bit over saturated. I can almost feel the froth of the milk but it''s just a little too far from my reach. Great try though.', '2005-07-20 03:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
