(1549609, 206273, 15711, '<td valign="top">Since the center is your main "event" of the shot, maybe zoom in on it for a true macro. As you did it, I''d bring up the colors more and really give it some POW.  If you had some area on one side or at the top or bottom, it wouldn''t appear as such a target, and be a bit more interesting to the eye.</td>', 'Since the center is your main "event" of the shot, maybe zoom in on it for a true macro. As you did it, I''d bring up the colors more and really give it some POW.  If you had some area on one side or at the top or bottom, it wouldn''t appear as such a target, and be a bit more interesting to the eye.', '2005-07-20 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1549610, 206290, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great fading effect.  This is so crips and interesting.  Great macro.  I like this alot - A for imagination. The stamens are so vivid against the white - good job!!! 9</td>', 'Great fading effect.  This is so crips and interesting.  Great macro.  I like this alot - A for imagination. The stamens are so vivid against the white - good job!!! 9', '2005-07-20 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
