(1549814, 206333, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!!   I had a shot almost exactly like this that I took while shooting the zoo challenge -- 2 days too early for the Textures challenge.    I went back to try to re-shoot it and get it in this challenge, but the elephant wouldn''t pose for me again.   I think I''m glad now he didn''t because this picture is probably much better  :)   Good job.</td>', 'Awesome!!!!   I had a shot almost exactly like this that I took while shooting the zoo challenge -- 2 days too early for the Textures challenge.    I went back to try to re-shoot it and get it in this challenge, but the elephant wouldn''t pose for me again.   I think I''m glad now he didn''t because this picture is probably much better  :)   Good job.', '2005-07-20 11:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1549815, 205948, 24073, '<td valign="top">beatiful photo.  For texture though, it doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'beatiful photo.  For texture though, it doesn''t seem to fit.', '2005-07-20 11:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
