(1549850, 203696, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Gorgeous beach scene, and I love the contrast of the texture of the water, and the super smooth texture of the sand.   Exotic beach scenes always have an edge with my vote because I think they are so beautiful  :)   10</td>', 'Wow!  Gorgeous beach scene, and I love the contrast of the texture of the water, and the super smooth texture of the sand.   Exotic beach scenes always have an edge with my vote because I think they are so beautiful  :)   10', '2005-07-20 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
