(1549866, 205898, 30061, '<td valign="top">What a neat shot!  It''s a great macro - the snail is in great focus, the shell shows texture very well.  I only have one complaint.  The bar/pole/brown object in the background.  My eye started at the shell and moved left, only to be distracted by the pole when it got there.</td>', 'What a neat shot!  It''s a great macro - the snail is in great focus, the shell shows texture very well.  I only have one complaint.  The bar/pole/brown object in the background.  My eye started at the shell and moved left, only to be distracted by the pole when it got there.', '2005-07-20 11:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1549867, 206105, 34906, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subjects here.  Well lit.  Curious about your decision to include the horizontal fiber and where you placed it.</td>', 'I like your choice of subjects here.  Well lit.  Curious about your decision to include the horizontal fiber and where you placed it.', '2005-07-20 11:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
