(1549884, 204016, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool!!!!    Alot ike one I wanted to submit.  I got it while shooting the zoo challenge, but when I went back to get it for the textures challenge, he wouldn''t pose again  :(  Anyway, yours is probably much better, so it worked out  :)   Excellent job.   The texture just jumps off the page at you!!!  10</td>', 'Very cool!!!!    Alot ike one I wanted to submit.  I got it while shooting the zoo challenge, but when I went back to get it for the textures challenge, he wouldn''t pose again  :(  Anyway, yours is probably much better, so it worked out  :)   Excellent job.   The texture just jumps off the page at you!!!  10', '2005-07-20 11:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1549885, 206167, 34906, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title.  Actually, he needs to be there for contrast, don''t you think?</td>', 'Wonderful title.  Actually, he needs to be there for contrast, don''t you think?', '2005-07-20 11:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1549886, 206333, 30061, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You won''t get any complaints that this doesn''t meet the challenge!  I love the shot, and the composition is good.  I do feel that compared to the rough, gritty look of the right side of the photo, the left side seems much smoother and makes the photo look a little unbalanced.  But that''s probably just me being too picky, so don''t worry about losing points over that. ;o)  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow.  You won''t get any complaints that this doesn''t meet the challenge!  I love the shot, and the composition is good.  I do feel that compared to the rough, gritty look of the right side of the photo, the left side seems much smoother and makes the photo look a little unbalanced.  But that''s probably just me being too picky, so don''t worry about losing points over that. ;o)  Great shot!', '2005-07-20 11:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1549887, 206388, 38677, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2005-07-20 11:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
