(1550063, 203800, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good symmetrical view of the weave.  Nice touch with the one strand slightly out of place. A lower perspective I believe would provide a little more sense of depth. 8 <br/>Exposure: Due to the shininess of the strands it seems a bit over exposed and the bright spots a little distracting. 6<br/>Impact: Above average.  The pattern of the weave is interesting and draws the viewer into the image though with a lower perspective I think more impact could be achieved. 6<br/> <br/>Overall: 7</td>', 'Composition: Good symmetrical view of the weave.  Nice touch with the one strand slightly out of place. A lower perspective I believe would provide a little more sense of depth. 8 Exposure: Due to the shininess of the strands it seems a bit over exposed and the bright spots a little distracting. 6Impact: Above average.  The pattern of the weave is interesting and draws the viewer into the image though with a lower perspective I think more impact could be achieved. 6 Overall: 7', '2005-07-20 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550070, 204961, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Good use of diagonals to add interest. With the lines of the strands I don''t know if a straight on view gives the best perspective.  However, some sense of depth is obtained from the weave. 6<br/>Exposure: Even though the texture and pattern of the strands can be seen quite clearly the image seems to be a little under exposed. 6<br/>Impact: The pattern is interesting though not enough to keep the viewer''s attention for more than a few seconds. 5<br/> <br/>Overall: 6</td>', 'Composition:  Good use of diagonals to add interest. With the lines of the strands I don''t know if a straight on view gives the best perspective.  However, some sense of depth is obtained from the weave. 6Exposure: Even though the texture and pattern of the strands can be seen quite clearly the image seems to be a little under exposed. 6Impact: The pattern is interesting though not enough to keep the viewer''s attention for more than a few seconds. 5 Overall: 6', '2005-07-20 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
