(1550113, 206241, 35786, '<td valign="top">nice but the button is very distracting</td>', 'nice but the button is very distracting', '2005-07-20 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550114, 204443, 32644, '<td valign="top">Great shot but too dark.</td>', 'Great shot but too dark.', '2005-07-20 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550115, 206466, 30061, '<td valign="top">Good job making these look tasty and still showing enough texture.  The focus (or, perhaps the actual berries) looks a little soft, especially in the middle and right berries.  But the composition is good - nice arrangement.  Overall, I like it. :)  Nice shot!</td>', 'Good job making these look tasty and still showing enough texture.  The focus (or, perhaps the actual berries) looks a little soft, especially in the middle and right berries.  But the composition is good - nice arrangement.  Overall, I like it. :)  Nice shot!', '2005-07-20 12:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550117, 204233, 40718, '<td valign="top">not enough context</td>', 'not enough context', '2005-07-20 12:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550119, 206100, 40718, '<td valign="top">hmmm,  I think the highlights actually remove some of the texture from the picture.</td>', 'hmmm,  I think the highlights actually remove some of the texture from the picture.', '2005-07-20 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550120, 206239, 32644, '<td valign="top">Too small and blurry</td>', 'Too small and blurry', '2005-07-20 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550128, 203940, 40718, '<td valign="top">neat composition, too bad the most "textured" part of the shot is slightly OOF</td>', 'neat composition, too bad the most "textured" part of the shot is slightly OOF', '2005-07-20 12:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550129, 205323, 40718, '<td valign="top">not enough context</td>', 'not enough context', '2005-07-20 12:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550130, 206440, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s an awesome composition.   Good job.   It looks a tiny bit hazy, but it''s still a great picture.  10</td>', 'Wow!  That''s an awesome composition.   Good job.   It looks a tiny bit hazy, but it''s still a great picture.  10', '2005-07-20 12:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550131, 203538, 40019, '<td valign="top">nice use of lighting</td>', 'nice use of lighting', '2005-07-20 12:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550132, 204627, 30061, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, good composition, incredible detail.  You met the challenge very well.  I even like the frame.  But I can''t help but feel like I''ve seen this shot before - quite a few times, actually.  This idea is used a lot, and so it''s rather hard to improve on it once someone''s done it well.  But overall, I do like the shot, and I won''t score you lower based on the creativity.  But next time, maybe consider a more unique subject. :o)</td>', 'Nice macro, good composition, incredible detail.  You met the challenge very well.  I even like the frame.  But I can''t help but feel like I''ve seen this shot before - quite a few times, actually.  This idea is used a lot, and so it''s rather hard to improve on it once someone''s done it well.  But overall, I do like the shot, and I won''t score you lower based on the creativity.  But next time, maybe consider a more unique subject. :o)', '2005-07-20 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550135, 203649, 40718, '<td valign="top">white is really, really hard to expose correctly for high contrast.  you picked a challenging subject, but didn''t pull it off.</td>', 'white is really, really hard to expose correctly for high contrast.  you picked a challenging subject, but didn''t pull it off.', '2005-07-20 12:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550138, 206239, 29557, '<td valign="top">i call brown on this one! congrats!</td>', 'i call brown on this one! congrats!', '2005-07-20 12:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550139, 206338, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Vibrant colors, and the water drops add great texture.   I really like this a lot.</td>', 'Very nice.  Vibrant colors, and the water drops add great texture.   I really like this a lot.', '2005-07-20 12:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550141, 206133, 40718, '<td valign="top">hmmm, neat pic, but do I feel "texture"?  I guess, if smooth is what we''re going for.</td>', 'hmmm, neat pic, but do I feel "texture"?  I guess, if smooth is what we''re going for.', '2005-07-20 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550142, 206125, 40718, '<td valign="top">not ennough context</td>', 'not ennough context', '2005-07-20 12:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550144, 203371, 24454, '<td valign="top">Love the texture in this.    such amazing detail in those feathers.  10</td>', 'Love the texture in this.    such amazing detail in those feathers.  10', '2005-07-20 12:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550148, 206301, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2005-07-20 12:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550149, 205040, 40019, '<td valign="top">Leaf was over saturated for my liking.</td>', 'Leaf was over saturated for my liking.', '2005-07-20 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550151, 204495, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like it, nice effect on the mirror</td>', 'I like it, nice effect on the mirror', '2005-07-20 12:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550153, 204446, 24454, '<td valign="top">THAT is a cool textures shot.   Not just TEXTURE. . . but an interesting, pleasing photo.  You did really good.  This may be my favorite in the challenge so far (and I''m almost done voting)!  10</td>', 'THAT is a cool textures shot.   Not just TEXTURE. . . but an interesting, pleasing photo.  You did really good.  This may be my favorite in the challenge so far (and I''m almost done voting)!  10', '2005-07-20 12:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550154, 206529, 30061, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this photo just doesn''t work.  The focus is too soft to really show any texture except blur, and by not showing more of her face, all you see is cheek.  There''s really nothing there to focus on.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this photo just doesn''t work.  The focus is too soft to really show any texture except blur, and by not showing more of her face, all you see is cheek.  There''s really nothing there to focus on.', '2005-07-20 12:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550157, 206534, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m sure we all really jacked the USM for this challenge, but maybe a little too much?  Still a good shot.</td>', 'I''m sure we all really jacked the USM for this challenge, but maybe a little too much?  Still a good shot.', '2005-07-20 12:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550158, 206557, 30061, '<td valign="top">What a cute idea!  Unfortunately, the lighting just doesn''t seem right - and I think it would be best if the background was either all black or all table.  Nice idea, though. :)</td>', 'What a cute idea!  Unfortunately, the lighting just doesn''t seem right - and I think it would be best if the background was either all black or all table.  Nice idea, though. :)', '2005-07-20 12:42:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1550160, 204473, 40718, '<td valign="top">hmm, nice texture.  personally I think the crop with only half the eagle''s mouth is a little distracting, you have to work it out in your mind which keeps wanting to assume his mouth is closed.</td>', 'hmm, nice texture.  personally I think the crop with only half the eagle''s mouth is a little distracting, you have to work it out in your mind which keeps wanting to assume his mouth is closed.', '2005-07-20 12:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550164, 206419, 40295, '<td valign="top">To me the emerging flower dominates the image too much and distracts me from the texture of the leaves. It may have worked better as a leading line if the bottom of the image were cropped a bit.</td>', 'To me the emerging flower dominates the image too much and distracts me from the texture of the leaves. It may have worked better as a leading line if the bottom of the image were cropped a bit.', '2005-07-20 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550166, 205933, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''d like it better if more of the leaf was in focus</td>', 'I''d like it better if more of the leaf was in focus', '2005-07-20 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550170, 206405, 40718, '<td valign="top">boy, black is a tough shade to reveal texture, you did a nice job though.</td>', 'boy, black is a tough shade to reveal texture, you did a nice job though.', '2005-07-20 12:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550171, 205897, 22551, '<td valign="top">Love the textures here - not sure I am crazy about the black background.  White background and more vivid lighting would have nailed this.</td>', 'Love the textures here - not sure I am crazy about the black background.  White background and more vivid lighting would have nailed this.', '2005-07-20 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550174, 206441, 40718, '<td valign="top">too much OOF</td>', 'too much OOF', '2005-07-20 12:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550175, 206297, 40718, '<td valign="top">ok, I dig this one, first posed shot I''ve really appreciated.  The wrench contrasts nicely with the rock. 8</td>', 'ok, I dig this one, first posed shot I''ve really appreciated.  The wrench contrasts nicely with the rock. 8', '2005-07-20 12:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550181, 204945, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice texture, not enough context</td>', 'nice texture, not enough context', '2005-07-20 12:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550195, 206169, 37719, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a stronger entry if the shot was closer and mosr of a contrast between the lichen and the rock were shown.</td>', 'I think this would have been a stronger entry if the shot was closer and mosr of a contrast between the lichen and the rock were shown.', '2005-07-20 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550197, 206142, 32644, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Just too small.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Just too small.', '2005-07-20 12:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
