(1550316, 206300, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1<br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>Nice, very nice.  Can''t wait to see what you used as a background, well done.  Usually I try to stay away from centered images but you''ve done this nicely by having the additional flower and the butterfly up so high.  Something tells me the colors could be enhanced a bit but not sure.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=1 Nice, very nice.  Can''t wait to see what you used as a background, well done.  Usually I try to stay away from centered images but you''ve done this nicely by having the additional flower and the butterfly up so high.  Something tells me the colors could be enhanced a bit but not sure. Good luck', '2005-07-20 13:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
