(1550752, 206494, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s very pretty, particularly the light... but seems a bit too soft IMO...I keep wanting to see more of the petal textures because I know they''re there somewhere...please do not get me wrong...I have nothing against "softness" in general...I just would have loved to have a bit more "texture" in this pretty rose.</td>', 'It''s very pretty, particularly the light... but seems a bit too soft IMO...I keep wanting to see more of the petal textures because I know they''re there somewhere...please do not get me wrong...I have nothing against "softness" in general...I just would have loved to have a bit more "texture" in this pretty rose.', '2005-07-20 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550754, 206023, 12327, '<td valign="top">yeah... I learned that it takes a pretty fast exposure to stop that tongue.  I have snakes in the backyard and I''ve been trying to get a good shot of one with the tongue out.  it goes out and back faster than I can press the shutter, and even if I catch one with the tongue out, it wiggles so fast that at 1/500th it''s still blurry.<br/>great shot.  (btw... my wife absolutelly despises snakes, she can''t even look at one without freaking out.</td>', 'yeah... I learned that it takes a pretty fast exposure to stop that tongue.  I have snakes in the backyard and I''ve been trying to get a good shot of one with the tongue out.  it goes out and back faster than I can press the shutter, and even if I catch one with the tongue out, it wiggles so fast that at 1/500th it''s still blurry.great shot.  (btw... my wife absolutelly despises snakes, she can''t even look at one without freaking out.', '2005-07-20 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
