(1550986, 206517, 30061, '<td valign="top">Very soft and pretty.  There seems to be little bit of grain that''s noticebale in the lower portion, but it''s not a lot.  Overall, I like it.</td>', 'Very soft and pretty.  There seems to be little bit of grain that''s noticebale in the lower portion, but it''s not a lot.  Overall, I like it.', '2005-07-20 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550988, 203825, 30061, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but there isn''t any portion of this shot that is in focus - if you can''t see the detail in the fringe, then you can''t tell the texture, either.  2</td>', 'I''m sorry, but there isn''t any portion of this shot that is in focus - if you can''t see the detail in the fringe, then you can''t tell the texture, either.  2', '2005-07-20 17:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551001, 203410, 30061, '<td valign="top">As hard as I''ve tried not to, I really, really like this.  I admit to being rather bored with leaves as a subject by now, because they''re so overdone, but this one is different somehow.  Perhaps it''s the dark outline around the veins, or the way the precise focus draws me up through the picture, I''m not sure.  But it''s gorgeous.  Great shot!</td>', 'As hard as I''ve tried not to, I really, really like this.  I admit to being rather bored with leaves as a subject by now, because they''re so overdone, but this one is different somehow.  Perhaps it''s the dark outline around the veins, or the way the precise focus draws me up through the picture, I''m not sure.  But it''s gorgeous.  Great shot!', '2005-07-20 17:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
