(1551443, 206225, 34659, '<td valign="top">This really is beautiful.  I love the muted tones - it really adds to the softness of the image, but I''d like to see just a hair more green.  :-)  By far, the best water shot in the challenge.  9</td>', 'This really is beautiful.  I love the muted tones - it really adds to the softness of the image, but I''d like to see just a hair more green.  :-)  By far, the best water shot in the challenge.  9', '2005-07-20 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551445, 206525, 19841, '<td valign="top">Clever lighting!  although, it does make the color and lighting more the theme of the image, rather than the texture.  Still, very pretty.</td>', 'Clever lighting!  although, it does make the color and lighting more the theme of the image, rather than the texture.  Still, very pretty.', '2005-07-20 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551450, 206579, 34659, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really cool shot with a lot of depth and detail, but I don''t think that B/W is doing it justice.  In fact, I can''t even determine what it is.  It could be dried flowers, it could be leaves, it could be a rotting sofa/chair, it could be a worn saddle bag.  I just don''t know.  HOWEVER, it does have a lot of texture that I can distinguish in it, so it''s getting a good vote - I just wanna know what it is!  LOL</td>', 'This looks like a really cool shot with a lot of depth and detail, but I don''t think that B/W is doing it justice.  In fact, I can''t even determine what it is.  It could be dried flowers, it could be leaves, it could be a rotting sofa/chair, it could be a worn saddle bag.  I just don''t know.  HOWEVER, it does have a lot of texture that I can distinguish in it, so it''s getting a good vote - I just wanna know what it is!  LOL', '2005-07-20 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551451, 205909, 35444, '<td valign="top">What a great picture this is.  It reminds me of a television commercial or something.  My husband sleeps with our cat exactly like this...lucky cat.</td>', 'What a great picture this is.  It reminds me of a television commercial or something.  My husband sleeps with our cat exactly like this...lucky cat.', '2005-07-20 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
