(1551459, 205986, 34659, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this image is too small to really distinguish much texture.  I think it has a lot of potential, I just wish I could see more of it.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this image is too small to really distinguish much texture.  I think it has a lot of potential, I just wish I could see more of it.', '2005-07-20 21:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551463, 205107, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  Funny how no one else thought of pears, and they have such a distinctive and familiar texture.  Nice choice, great DOF, and the lighting &amp; composition are both very good.  BTW, are they from Harry &amp; David?  (I love those!)</td>', 'Really nice shot.  Funny how no one else thought of pears, and they have such a distinctive and familiar texture.  Nice choice, great DOF, and the lighting & composition are both very good.  BTW, are they from Harry & David?  (I love those!)', '2005-07-20 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551465, 203467, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1<br/> <br/>Really nice use of b/w and depth of field to draw attention to the texture and not the entire leaf.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1 Really nice use of b/w and depth of field to draw attention to the texture and not the entire leaf. Good luck', '2005-07-20 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551469, 205380, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot and crop.  Not sure I''m crazy about the border (as I think it''s off just a shade or two from the main red colors in the image).  Bone certainly has a distinctive texture, as do beads, feathers, and paint.  I like this, although I think the right side is a little too dark.  I think you could lighten it a few levels, getting more detail from the subject, and without losing the beautiful contrast of light &amp; dark you so artistically chose.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very interesting shot and crop.  Not sure I''m crazy about the border (as I think it''s off just a shade or two from the main red colors in the image).  Bone certainly has a distinctive texture, as do beads, feathers, and paint.  I like this, although I think the right side is a little too dark.  I think you could lighten it a few levels, getting more detail from the subject, and without losing the beautiful contrast of light & dark you so artistically chose.  Nice work.', '2005-07-20 21:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551471, 206055, 35444, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject.  I feel, though, that it is a little blown out, making it too bright/blurry or something.  That notwithstanding I still ''feel'' this picture.</td>', 'This is a great subject.  I feel, though, that it is a little blown out, making it too bright/blurry or something.  That notwithstanding I still ''feel'' this picture.', '2005-07-20 21:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551472, 206069, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Nice DOF and I like the muted colors/tones.  I also think the border works very well with this image.  I''m not sure you got as much definition as you could have in the "focused" areas - would like to see a little more.  Still, a very unique and interesting entry.  Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Nice DOF and I like the muted colors/tones.  I also think the border works very well with this image.  I''m not sure you got as much definition as you could have in the "focused" areas - would like to see a little more.  Still, a very unique and interesting entry.  Nice work.', '2005-07-20 21:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551473, 205632, 35444, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture a lot.  I like the composition and the lighting and the colors.</td>', 'I really like this picture a lot.  I like the composition and the lighting and the colors.', '2005-07-20 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
