(1551480, 206072, 34659, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this shot and bumping it up...  Wonderful textures on the flower bloom and plant.  The bee bothers me a little.  It doesn''t seem to have the same attention to color and detail that the rest of the image does.  Nice composition - I like the offset you chose; it''s nicely balanced with the larger leaf.  Good job.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this shot and bumping it up...  Wonderful textures on the flower bloom and plant.  The bee bothers me a little.  It doesn''t seem to have the same attention to color and detail that the rest of the image does.  Nice composition - I like the offset you chose; it''s nicely balanced with the larger leaf.  Good job.', '2005-07-20 21:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551483, 206305, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the bloom, but it seems like there should be more detail on the stem - it''s almost as blurred as the background.  Nice colors and composition though.  Good job.</td>', 'Great detail on the bloom, but it seems like there should be more detail on the stem - it''s almost as blurred as the background.  Nice colors and composition though.  Good job.', '2005-07-20 21:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551486, 206397, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this old wreck in another challenge (not this particular shot, but the same boat).  I could be wrong...  ;-)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this is a great shot.  Beautifully detailed, composed, and toned.  Really shows a lot of texture.  The sky is a little blah, but still a very strong entry - good job.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this old wreck in another challenge (not this particular shot, but the same boat).  I could be wrong...  ;-) Anyway, I think this is a great shot.  Beautifully detailed, composed, and toned.  Really shows a lot of texture.  The sky is a little blah, but still a very strong entry - good job.', '2005-07-20 21:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551488, 205328, 40718, '<td valign="top">I almost did this same shot.  I think it would be better if you angled the shot a bit so the mug is a bit less abstract.</td>', 'I almost did this same shot.  I think it would be better if you angled the shot a bit so the mug is a bit less abstract.', '2005-07-20 21:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
