(1552286, 205730, 24073, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, one of the best for sure.  The only thing that is a negative about this picture, and it may only be me, is that the sky looks so artificial.  But like I said that may only be personal preference, I still have you in my top 5 of the challenge.  GL.</td>', 'I really like this image, one of the best for sure.  The only thing that is a negative about this picture, and it may only be me, is that the sky looks so artificial.  But like I said that may only be personal preference, I still have you in my top 5 of the challenge.  GL.', '2005-07-21 08:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552294, 205844, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very artistic, and the kind of picture that makes me love photography.  Great Creativity, great lighting, great subject, technicals seem strong, I really like the border.  Its really hard for me to nit pick this one, because it seems so solid of an entry.  But if I had to piick something I might say the subject should be on the left instead of right, because his gaze is staring up and right.  Even with saying that I dont know it would make the picture better, it is probably more personal preference than anything.  GL to ya mate, i hope you do well.</td>', 'Very artistic, and the kind of picture that makes me love photography.  Great Creativity, great lighting, great subject, technicals seem strong, I really like the border.  Its really hard for me to nit pick this one, because it seems so solid of an entry.  But if I had to piick something I might say the subject should be on the left instead of right, because his gaze is staring up and right.  Even with saying that I dont know it would make the picture better, it is probably more personal preference than anything.  GL to ya mate, i hope you do well.', '2005-07-21 08:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552298, 206521, 29462, '<td valign="top">You found a lovely subject for the shot, but the background is quite distracting and theres a lot of noise.</td>', 'You found a lovely subject for the shot, but the background is quite distracting and theres a lot of noise.', '2005-07-21 08:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552299, 203565, 24073, '<td valign="top">You know I have to admit I did not score most flowers high, it just seemed to many people had the idea.  When you put this one down so elegently, and beatiful I made the exception.  This is certainly the best flower photo entered in my opinion, and it meets the texture challege dead on.  GL to you mate, I hope you do well.</td>', 'You know I have to admit I did not score most flowers high, it just seemed to many people had the idea.  When you put this one down so elegently, and beatiful I made the exception.  This is certainly the best flower photo entered in my opinion, and it meets the texture challege dead on.  GL to you mate, I hope you do well.', '2005-07-21 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552303, 205365, 24073, '<td valign="top">Ok after voting and going back, this was one of the ones that I bumped up a notch.  I really do like this shot, and I have found my self drawn back to it at least a half a dozen times.  I think what I like about this photo is that you nailed texture for one, and for two the colors in the back are absolutely gorgeus.  Very warm, and cozy, maybe soothing is a good word.  Anyway, gl to ya mate, i hope you do well.</td>', 'Ok after voting and going back, this was one of the ones that I bumped up a notch.  I really do like this shot, and I have found my self drawn back to it at least a half a dozen times.  I think what I like about this photo is that you nailed texture for one, and for two the colors in the back are absolutely gorgeus.  Very warm, and cozy, maybe soothing is a good word.  Anyway, gl to ya mate, i hope you do well.', '2005-07-21 08:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552310, 204775, 27524, '<td valign="top">Uh, on such zoom it looks like everything not orange :). Creative idea but i think could make more appealing compozition.</td>', 'Uh, on such zoom it looks like everything not orange :). Creative idea but i think could make more appealing compozition.', '2005-07-21 08:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
