(1552807, 206496, 27482, '<td valign="top">There are two things that really bother me about this image and caused me to give it a score below average.<br/> <br/>1.  The red colour is very unnatural and makes me think of blood rather than a sunset.<br/> <br/>2.  Having lens flare is always bad in an image IMHO but here it is extra bad since it is the only thing in the image that isn´t red, black or white and therefore draws extra much attention.<br/> <br/>On the plus side it wasn´t a bad idea to take a shot of the ocean like this but I don´t really like the outcome.  Sorry.</td>', 'There are two things that really bother me about this image and caused me to give it a score below average. 1.  The red colour is very unnatural and makes me think of blood rather than a sunset. 2.  Having lens flare is always bad in an image IMHO but here it is extra bad since it is the only thing in the image that isn´t red, black or white and therefore draws extra much attention. On the plus side it wasn´t a bad idea to take a shot of the ocean like this but I don´t really like the outcome.  Sorry.', '2005-07-21 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
