(1552895, 204802, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 0/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>I''m not really attracted to this photo at all. It is very bland and lacks any real point of interest.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Color/Contrast: 0/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 I''m not really attracted to this photo at all. It is very bland and lacks any real point of interest.', '2005-07-21 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552896, 206276, 21202, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I do not like solid blue background nor guns, but a 9 nevertheless.</td>', 'Well done.  I do not like solid blue background nor guns, but a 9 nevertheless.', '2005-07-21 14:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552900, 203583, 27482, '<td valign="top">Normally I like shallow DOF images but here it´s IMO irritatingly shallow as there is soo little in focus I just want to squint my eyes to see the rest of the peanuts.  In short a good idea but slightly over the top for my taste.  Gave it a 5.</td>', 'Normally I like shallow DOF images but here it´s IMO irritatingly shallow as there is soo little in focus I just want to squint my eyes to see the rest of the peanuts.  In short a good idea but slightly over the top for my taste.  Gave it a 5.', '2005-07-21 14:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552902, 204912, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>The lighting is too harsh IMHO. Numbers probably should have been more level in the photo. Cropping seems too odd. Not sure if it would look better with more or less though.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 The lighting is too harsh IMHO. Numbers probably should have been more level in the photo. Cropping seems too odd. Not sure if it would look better with more or less though.', '2005-07-21 14:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552903, 206181, 36882, '<td valign="top">i really like the smooth texture to this , it brings it out alive <br/>keep up the good work</td>', 'i really like the smooth texture to this , it brings it out alive keep up the good work', '2005-07-21 14:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552909, 206273, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Good flower shot. The Even lighting is very pleasant on this photo. The composition is a little odd. Centered flower doesn''t work too well IMHO. Edges of petals look like too much sharpening was applied also.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Good flower shot. The Even lighting is very pleasant on this photo. The composition is a little odd. Centered flower doesn''t work too well IMHO. Edges of petals look like too much sharpening was applied also.', '2005-07-21 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552911, 204836, 27562, '<td valign="top">Best elephant butt shot so far ;-)</td>', 'Best elephant butt shot so far ;-)', '2005-07-21 14:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
