(1553272, 203301, 40386, '<td valign="top">Great idea, needs to be a bit brighter, it looks a bit flat, try upping the brightness and increasing the contrast, or maybe adjust the curves if you have photoshop.  A closer crop might have helped too.</td>', 'Great idea, needs to be a bit brighter, it looks a bit flat, try upping the brightness and increasing the contrast, or maybe adjust the curves if you have photoshop.  A closer crop might have helped too.', '2005-07-21 19:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
