(1553494, 205996, 30061, '<td valign="top">I have to say that I really don''t understand where your title came from.  The shot''s okay, not bad at all, but not spectacular either.  5</td>', 'I have to say that I really don''t understand where your title came from.  The shot''s okay, not bad at all, but not spectacular either.  5', '2005-07-21 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553495, 205137, 34659, '<td valign="top">Yummy, delicious, and excellent textures.  The highlights are a little bright in the butter and the very colorful background may be a tad distracting, but tough to take much off for anything in this shot.  Nice composition too.  8</td>', 'Yummy, delicious, and excellent textures.  The highlights are a little bright in the butter and the very colorful background may be a tad distracting, but tough to take much off for anything in this shot.  Nice composition too.  8', '2005-07-21 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553498, 204822, 30061, '<td valign="top">This just strikes me as odd, for some reason.  I understand that you''re probably wanting to focus on the texture of the tail feathers, yet I can''t see why you wouldn''t include the entire bird.</td>', 'This just strikes me as odd, for some reason.  I understand that you''re probably wanting to focus on the texture of the tail feathers, yet I can''t see why you wouldn''t include the entire bird.', '2005-07-21 20:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
