(1553531, 205272, 35786, '<td valign="top">i usually don''t like images of knick knacks or other works of art but you managed this very well- particularly with the shadows to bring out the most texture possible- good work</td>', 'i usually don''t like images of knick knacks or other works of art but you managed this very well- particularly with the shadows to bring out the most texture possible- good work', '2005-07-21 20:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
