(1553550, 205871, 14736, '<td valign="top">the photo has an overall hazy look to it.  there are many ways to fix this in photoshop.  you can PM or email me for a few of my favorite methods.</td>', 'the photo has an overall hazy look to it.  there are many ways to fix this in photoshop.  you can PM or email me for a few of my favorite methods.', '2005-07-21 21:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
