(1553558, 206554, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very good use of light to show the 3D shape here.  Not quite sure what it is though - It doesn''t look like moisture to me.  But what do I know?  Nice pic.</td>', 'Very good use of light to show the 3D shape here.  Not quite sure what it is though - It doesn''t look like moisture to me.  But what do I know?  Nice pic.', '2005-07-21 21:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
