(1554384, 205979, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am terribly sorry but this photo doesn´t do anything for me.  To be more specific the blown out highlight of what I assume is a flash or some kind of lamp kills this shot for me personally and there is nothing good in the image that counterweights that.  Also the image is very flat contrast wise and soft and the overexposure combined with the strong shadow draws the attention away from what little texture there is in the shot.  I gave it a 3 though since I has some traces of texture but if it had been off topic I would have given it a 1.  <br/> <br/>On the plus side you seem to have been experimenting with lightsources and experimentation is always good so keep it up, practice makes perfect.</td>', 'I am terribly sorry but this photo doesn´t do anything for me.  To be more specific the blown out highlight of what I assume is a flash or some kind of lamp kills this shot for me personally and there is nothing good in the image that counterweights that.  Also the image is very flat contrast wise and soft and the overexposure combined with the strong shadow draws the attention away from what little texture there is in the shot.  I gave it a 3 though since I has some traces of texture but if it had been off topic I would have given it a 1.   On the plus side you seem to have been experimenting with lightsources and experimentation is always good so keep it up, practice makes perfect.', '2005-07-22 06:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
