(1554388, 204835, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I don´t really like this picture, I get slight vertigo from viewing it since it´s taken at such a wierd angle and I find it very off putting.  Also you don´t immediately see what the subject is, if I may make one suggestion it would be to try and keep it simple and get closer to one subject instead of having 4 of them, sometimes less is more.<br/> <br/>On the plus side the exposure seems spot on although the lighting seems to be a bit flat and its on topic, you got a 4 from me.</td>', 'I am sorry but I don´t really like this picture, I get slight vertigo from viewing it since it´s taken at such a wierd angle and I find it very off putting.  Also you don´t immediately see what the subject is, if I may make one suggestion it would be to try and keep it simple and get closer to one subject instead of having 4 of them, sometimes less is more. On the plus side the exposure seems spot on although the lighting seems to be a bit flat and its on topic, you got a 4 from me.', '2005-07-22 06:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
