(1554390, 204225, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hardly original but interesting composition, I at least can feel the snakeskin through viewing this shot.  I only gave it a 5 though since it seems to be slightly out of focus, I looked everywhere and I can´t make out one spot that is pristine sharp except for maybe just at the top in the middle but I am still not sure.  Would have given it maybe even a 7 if it had been sharper and some better lighting (softer to be specifig) to increase the 3D feel to it.</td>', 'Hardly original but interesting composition, I at least can feel the snakeskin through viewing this shot.  I only gave it a 5 though since it seems to be slightly out of focus, I looked everywhere and I can´t make out one spot that is pristine sharp except for maybe just at the top in the middle but I am still not sure.  Would have given it maybe even a 7 if it had been sharper and some better lighting (softer to be specifig) to increase the 3D feel to it.', '2005-07-22 06:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
