(1554475, 205934, 36616, '<td valign="top">Could really feel the texture here. well done</td>', 'Could really feel the texture here. well done', '2005-07-22 08:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554476, 205127, 36616, '<td valign="top">I probably feel the emotion more than the texture but would still love to cuddle  him.</td>', 'I probably feel the emotion more than the texture but would still love to cuddle  him.', '2005-07-22 08:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554479, 206575, 36616, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea. Not quite sharp enough for my taste. Worth a 6 though</td>', 'Terrific idea. Not quite sharp enough for my taste. Worth a 6 though', '2005-07-22 08:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554485, 204139, 36616, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of a nice dog but the texture isn''t captured for me. Perhaps more sharpening would have brought up the hair a bit</td>', 'Nice pic of a nice dog but the texture isn''t captured for me. Perhaps more sharpening would have brought up the hair a bit', '2005-07-22 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554490, 205918, 36616, '<td valign="top">The out of focus buildings spoil  this one for me. The texture in the foreground is all a similar grey colour which makes the whole rather dull.</td>', 'The out of focus buildings spoil  this one for me. The texture in the foreground is all a similar grey colour which makes the whole rather dull.', '2005-07-22 09:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554492, 206492, 36616, '<td valign="top">Some textures there but there is no focus on any of them. Perhaps choose one and highlight it in some way.</td>', 'Some textures there but there is no focus on any of them. Perhaps choose one and highlight it in some way.', '2005-07-22 09:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554494, 206051, 36616, '<td valign="top">Textured definitely -  just not attractive as a pic for me -</td>', 'Textured definitely -  just not attractive as a pic for me -', '2005-07-22 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554498, 205617, 36616, '<td valign="top">Technically good pic but no texture feel for me. I am looking for 3d feel and this says grain but smooth.</td>', 'Technically good pic but no texture feel for me. I am looking for 3d feel and this says grain but smooth.', '2005-07-22 09:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554500, 203824, 37272, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2005-07-22 09:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554506, 205140, 36616, '<td valign="top">Nice model, good colours, composition. Dislike noise in pic, and I do not feel texture here as much as I do in some of the other pics.</td>', 'Nice model, good colours, composition. Dislike noise in pic, and I do not feel texture here as much as I do in some of the other pics.', '2005-07-22 09:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554507, 206407, 35602, '<td valign="top">I say kill it.  I have potatoes growing in my garden and I really don''t want to see one of these.  You did a very clear macro.  Tje sirrpimdomg textiure creates a real contrast against the smoothness of this guy.</td>', 'I say kill it.  I have potatoes growing in my garden and I really don''t want to see one of these.  You did a very clear macro.  Tje sirrpimdomg textiure creates a real contrast against the smoothness of this guy.', '2005-07-22 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554511, 204615, 35602, '<td valign="top">Didn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Didn''t do much for me.', '2005-07-22 09:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554515, 205807, 37272, '<td valign="top">Impressive, I can feel the freshness...</td>', 'Impressive, I can feel the freshness...', '2005-07-22 09:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554519, 206465, 36616, '<td valign="top">Looks like a science lesson! I like the interplay of the light beams in the centre but find the contrast with the prism too harsh. I feel texture only very gently.</td>', 'Looks like a science lesson! I like the interplay of the light beams in the centre but find the contrast with the prism too harsh. I feel texture only very gently.', '2005-07-22 09:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554520, 203413, 35602, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see better depiction of texture at the bottom of the image, ascending up to the top and getting blurrier the farther it climbed.  If you had stepped back slightly, then looked up, the bottom may have been clearer.</td>', 'I would have liked to see better depiction of texture at the bottom of the image, ascending up to the top and getting blurrier the farther it climbed.  If you had stepped back slightly, then looked up, the bottom may have been clearer.', '2005-07-22 09:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554524, 204751, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was really out of focus.</td>', 'This was really out of focus.', '2005-07-22 09:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554528, 206311, 36616, '<td valign="top">Good idea, colours should work well. Nice textures in the bottom right hand corner but the upper half of the pic is too bright/harsh for my taste.</td>', 'Good idea, colours should work well. Nice textures in the bottom right hand corner but the upper half of the pic is too bright/harsh for my taste.', '2005-07-22 09:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554534, 204934, 35602, '<td valign="top">Cropping out the bank would have made this image almost float in a pool of primordial fog.  I think it would have definitely given this image a lot more impact.  After all the texture is the moss on the stone in contrast to the incredible softness of the water.</td>', 'Cropping out the bank would have made this image almost float in a pool of primordial fog.  I think it would have definitely given this image a lot more impact.  After all the texture is the moss on the stone in contrast to the incredible softness of the water.', '2005-07-22 09:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554535, 206304, 36616, '<td valign="top">Not enough signs of washing up to be married for long!<br/>Like the idea and good signs of skin texture but maybe a little too muted. Lighting effective (except blown out areas).</td>', 'Not enough signs of washing up to be married for long!Like the idea and good signs of skin texture but maybe a little too muted. Lighting effective (except blown out areas).', '2005-07-22 09:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554539, 203824, 36616, '<td valign="top">It''s good to learn - noctilucent, another new word to me. I like the feeling I get from this sky, it has a gentle texture</td>', 'It''s good to learn - noctilucent, another new word to me. I like the feeling I get from this sky, it has a gentle texture', '2005-07-22 09:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554540, 206569, 36616, '<td valign="top">Terrific texture, I can really feel it here. well done.</td>', 'Terrific texture, I can really feel it here. well done.', '2005-07-22 09:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554542, 205602, 34192, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot for an advertisement.  The lighting is great, the DOF and POV excellent, color/tone well done.  8- good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This would be a great shot for an advertisement.  The lighting is great, the DOF and POV excellent, color/tone well done.  8- good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-22 09:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554543, 205616, 36616, '<td valign="top">Good angle to show the texture well. Well done on capturing an attractive pattern at the same time.</td>', 'Good angle to show the texture well. Well done on capturing an attractive pattern at the same time.', '2005-07-22 09:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554547, 204560, 36616, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity. Good texture, let down by the lighting - especially at the bottom of the shot where there should not be a highlight. An angled light  to rake across the surface would have shown the texture more.</td>', 'Love the simplicity. Good texture, let down by the lighting - especially at the bottom of the shot where there should not be a highlight. An angled light  to rake across the surface would have shown the texture more.', '2005-07-22 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554549, 206257, 36616, '<td valign="top">Cuddly apart from the horns. Well done I can feel the texture of that hair.</td>', 'Cuddly apart from the horns. Well done I can feel the texture of that hair.', '2005-07-22 09:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554550, 203646, 9780, '<td valign="top">10. like the B/W nice expression. small movement on the hands indecates that she is moving. + for that. 10+</td>', '10. like the B/W nice expression. small movement on the hands indecates that she is moving. + for that. 10+', '2005-07-22 09:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554551, 204072, 36616, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the pachyderm shots, hoping for a good placing for this one.</td>', 'My favourite of the pachyderm shots, hoping for a good placing for this one.', '2005-07-22 09:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554552, 206397, 36616, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in this challenge, I can really feel the texture of that old wood</td>', 'One of my favourites in this challenge, I can really feel the texture of that old wood', '2005-07-22 09:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554554, 204041, 21816, '<td valign="top">Ummmm......hmmmm.......</td>', 'Ummmm......hmmmm.......', '2005-07-22 09:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554560, 205211, 36616, '<td valign="top">You''re a vicious cruel person to deny access to water, poor puppy!<br/>Interesting texture, would probably have worked in any colour except black - 7</td>', 'You''re a vicious cruel person to deny access to water, poor puppy!Interesting texture, would probably have worked in any colour except black - 7', '2005-07-22 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554562, 204906, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good effort but 2 things that stop this from being more than average IMHO.  <br/> <br/>1.  Lighting is too harsh to really let the texture of the lizards skin stand out more.<br/> <br/>2.  The noise in the image is too much for my taste, especially combined with the harsh lighting.<br/> <br/>5 from me.</td>', 'Good effort but 2 things that stop this from being more than average IMHO.   1.  Lighting is too harsh to really let the texture of the lizards skin stand out more. 2.  The noise in the image is too much for my taste, especially combined with the harsh lighting. 5 from me.', '2005-07-22 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554565, 206535, 36616, '<td valign="top">I''m still not sure I believe you about the natural colour. Fantastic pic really needed to be levered in to any challenge. Love the shapes. I think I feel the texture of this only very gently.</td>', 'I''m still not sure I believe you about the natural colour. Fantastic pic really needed to be levered in to any challenge. Love the shapes. I think I feel the texture of this only very gently.', '2005-07-22 09:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554566, 206167, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Is that Obelix?  Good photo but not great.  On the plus side it´s got good colours contrast/sharpness.  On the minus side it´s shot at a wierd angle so it causes slilght vertigo when I view it, I am not sure if I am looking down on the cat or up at it or if he is sitting up on a wall and it just confuses me.<br/> <br/>6 from me.</td>', 'Hmmm... Is that Obelix?  Good photo but not great.  On the plus side it´s got good colours contrast/sharpness.  On the minus side it´s shot at a wierd angle so it causes slilght vertigo when I view it, I am not sure if I am looking down on the cat or up at it or if he is sitting up on a wall and it just confuses me. 6 from me.', '2005-07-22 09:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554568, 206221, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the symmetry and colours in this shot but it´s too loosely tied in with the challenge theme IMHO to make me want to give it more than 7.</td>', 'Love the symmetry and colours in this shot but it´s too loosely tied in with the challenge theme IMHO to make me want to give it more than 7.', '2005-07-22 09:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554570, 206299, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all but it´s slightly underexposed and that causes it to be a bit flat and makes the colours a bit dull.  If I may suggest on how to improve this it would be to expose about 1/2 to a full stop more and correct the WB to a warmer colour and I bet you would like the outcome more.</td>', 'Not bad at all but it´s slightly underexposed and that causes it to be a bit flat and makes the colours a bit dull.  If I may suggest on how to improve this it would be to expose about 1/2 to a full stop more and correct the WB to a warmer colour and I bet you would like the outcome more.', '2005-07-22 09:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554575, 203847, 36437, '<td valign="top">this shot is really nice...love detail..good luke!</td>', 'this shot is really nice...love detail..good luke!', '2005-07-22 10:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
