(1554610, 206235, 36437, '<td valign="top">Great DOF!</td>', 'Great DOF!', '2005-07-22 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554612, 206543, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat.  I like the lighting and depth of field.</td>', 'Neat.  I like the lighting and depth of field.', '2005-07-22 10:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554613, 206390, 9690, '<td valign="top">Good grief, that''s ugly!<br/> <br/>Very good capture.  Great detail.</td>', 'Good grief, that''s ugly! Very good capture.  Great detail.', '2005-07-22 10:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554617, 205465, 9964, '<td valign="top">great b&amp;w composition</td>', 'great b&w composition', '2005-07-22 10:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554620, 205365, 9964, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2005-07-22 10:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554624, 205294, 34192, '<td valign="top">gotta be Iceland. :)  I think what makes this image is the inclusion of a person.  Doesn''t hurt that the tones were excellently rendered, the DOF and Focus dead on and the POV perfect.  I can overlook the spots (clean your camera!) as this is a basic challenge.  Excellent job! 10- goodluck in the challenge!</td>', 'gotta be Iceland. :)  I think what makes this image is the inclusion of a person.  Doesn''t hurt that the tones were excellently rendered, the DOF and Focus dead on and the POV perfect.  I can overlook the spots (clean your camera!) as this is a basic challenge.  Excellent job! 10- goodluck in the challenge!', '2005-07-22 10:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554628, 205730, 34192, '<td valign="top">For a basic challenge, this is incredible.  I think what really makes this image 10 worthy is the lighting - you got there at the perfect time of day.  The sky is a little green but I''m overlooking that as it really isn''t that noticible.  The texture shines through very well.  The POV and composition are excellent.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'For a basic challenge, this is incredible.  I think what really makes this image 10 worthy is the lighting - you got there at the perfect time of day.  The sky is a little green but I''m overlooking that as it really isn''t that noticible.  The texture shines through very well.  The POV and composition are excellent.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-22 10:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554630, 206227, 39553, '<td valign="top">There''s texture there, but it''s a bit 2D and also a little out of focus I think.  A more acute angle may have worked better to bring out the 3D and give perspective...</td>', 'There''s texture there, but it''s a bit 2D and also a little out of focus I think.  A more acute angle may have worked better to bring out the 3D and give perspective...', '2005-07-22 10:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554631, 205532, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m really glad I decided to vote on them all - otherwise I would have missed this one as it came up almost last.  The use of B&amp;W is excellent - tonal range well done.  Like the crop/composition and POV.  The DOF works for me.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I''m really glad I decided to vote on them all - otherwise I would have missed this one as it came up almost last.  The use of B&W is excellent - tonal range well done.  Like the crop/composition and POV.  The DOF works for me.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-22 10:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554632, 205993, 39553, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadows for the texture... good colour, well focussed.  I wonder if a closer crop of the wing may have made the texture a more prominent theme in the image though...</td>', 'Nice use of shadows for the texture... good colour, well focussed.  I wonder if a closer crop of the wing may have made the texture a more prominent theme in the image though...', '2005-07-22 10:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554634, 205016, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Not sure about all the negative space.  The tones are great as is the lighting.  POV, DOF excellent. 8 - Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Not sure about all the negative space.  The tones are great as is the lighting.  POV, DOF excellent. 8 - Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-22 10:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554636, 205127, 9690, '<td valign="top">Don''t be an "ass," Ed was a horse, of course!</td>', 'Don''t be an "ass," Ed was a horse, of course!', '2005-07-22 10:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554637, 205550, 9690, '<td valign="top">This pic is rated "aaarrrrrrrrrrrr"</td>', 'This pic is rated "aaarrrrrrrrrrrr"', '2005-07-22 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554639, 206467, 33400, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting to bring out the three dimensions here.  Meets the challenge very well and is aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'Excellent lighting to bring out the three dimensions here.  Meets the challenge very well and is aesthetically pleasing.', '2005-07-22 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554643, 203686, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very very neat.... reminds me of MST3000</td>', 'Very very neat.... reminds me of MST3000', '2005-07-22 10:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554644, 206336, 34192, '<td valign="top">What caught my eye with this image were the tones.  I think the red roof is what really makes this image work.  The bottom is a little dark but I like that it was taken on an overcast day - sunlight wouldn''t have given you the texture or the tones.  From my view, you were standing just a little bit right of center - just barely noticible but I think it creates some tension in the image (a good thing as it helps the image not seem static). 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'What caught my eye with this image were the tones.  I think the red roof is what really makes this image work.  The bottom is a little dark but I like that it was taken on an overcast day - sunlight wouldn''t have given you the texture or the tones.  From my view, you were standing just a little bit right of center - just barely noticible but I think it creates some tension in the image (a good thing as it helps the image not seem static). 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-22 10:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554646, 205890, 38997, '<td valign="top">wow this makes me want to eat a kiwi, i can almost taste it</td>', 'wow this makes me want to eat a kiwi, i can almost taste it', '2005-07-22 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
