(1554990, 206152, 30605, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautifull shot. Nice contrast with the violet and yellow. Is it natural or post-editing? Anyway, looks good especially with the perspective. It''s unfortunate the sky''s not saturated enough (for my taste).</td>', 'Wow, beautifull shot. Nice contrast with the violet and yellow. Is it natural or post-editing? Anyway, looks good especially with the perspective. It''s unfortunate the sky''s not saturated enough (for my taste).', '2005-07-22 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554993, 205983, 32893, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the bud.  Nice color differential.  Love the water beads.  Good DOF.</td>', 'Excellent focus on the bud.  Nice color differential.  Love the water beads.  Good DOF.', '2005-07-22 14:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554995, 206547, 30605, '<td valign="top">Well, composition''s good. Seems unfocussed. And way to much noise.</td>', 'Well, composition''s good. Seems unfocussed. And way to much noise.', '2005-07-22 14:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554996, 204785, 32893, '<td valign="top">More saturation would help.  Lighten the shadow area....levels.</td>', 'More saturation would help.  Lighten the shadow area....levels.', '2005-07-22 14:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554997, 203651, 5508, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2005-07-22 14:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554998, 205928, 32893, '<td valign="top">Needs more DOF.</td>', 'Needs more DOF.', '2005-07-22 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554999, 206581, 30061, '<td valign="top">Unique shot with a lot of character.  The lighting seems a bit harsh (most noticeably in the bright spot in the middle of the one that says Easter) but I like the composition, as well as the frame. 7</td>', 'Unique shot with a lot of character.  The lighting seems a bit harsh (most noticeably in the bright spot in the middle of the one that says Easter) but I like the composition, as well as the frame. 7', '2005-07-22 14:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555000, 206440, 32893, '<td valign="top">Unsharp would enhance this image.</td>', 'Unsharp would enhance this image.', '2005-07-22 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555002, 206338, 30605, '<td valign="top">Well executed. I like the contrast between the dark green leave and the lighter green effect of the water drops.</td>', 'Well executed. I like the contrast between the dark green leave and the lighter green effect of the water drops.', '2005-07-22 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555003, 206468, 32893, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good detail on the wire and post.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good detail on the wire and post.', '2005-07-22 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555004, 206431, 30605, '<td valign="top">Unfocused ?</td>', 'Unfocused ?', '2005-07-22 14:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555006, 205633, 30061, '<td valign="top">You lose points for getting a song on my mind.  ;o)  Nah, I''m kidding.  This is a cool shot, I like the framing of the wick.</td>', 'You lose points for getting a song on my mind.  ;o)  Nah, I''m kidding.  This is a cool shot, I like the framing of the wick.', '2005-07-22 14:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555010, 205595, 30605, '<td valign="top">Hightlight on ground to intense. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Hightlight on ground to intense. Interesting composition.', '2005-07-22 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555013, 206530, 30061, '<td valign="top">This definitely shows texture, but there''s not really much here to capture the viewer''s interest, in my opinion.  I would like to have seen what makes *this* piece of wood unique.  Why is it any better or different than any other piece of wood?  Nice choice of frame.  6</td>', 'This definitely shows texture, but there''s not really much here to capture the viewer''s interest, in my opinion.  I would like to have seen what makes *this* piece of wood unique.  Why is it any better or different than any other piece of wood?  Nice choice of frame.  6', '2005-07-22 14:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555015, 206428, 30061, '<td valign="top">Elephants always look so sad.  Very nice composition, and texture.  7</td>', 'Elephants always look so sad.  Very nice composition, and texture.  7', '2005-07-22 14:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555017, 206325, 32893, '<td valign="top">Good DOF; saturation might be intensified a bit.  Perspective could be improved.  Still very nice!</td>', 'Good DOF; saturation might be intensified a bit.  Perspective could be improved.  Still very nice!', '2005-07-22 14:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555018, 203618, 30605, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting well done. Very crisp.</td>', 'Composition and lighting well done. Very crisp.', '2005-07-22 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555020, 203893, 30061, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - angle, texture, color, composition.  The title, however, seems a little odd to me.  Also, there seems to be a diagonal texture on the yellow/orange background that distracts slightly from the feather.  Overall, though, I love it.  8</td>', 'I really like this shot - angle, texture, color, composition.  The title, however, seems a little odd to me.  Also, there seems to be a diagonal texture on the yellow/orange background that distracts slightly from the feather.  Overall, though, I love it.  8', '2005-07-22 14:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555024, 205580, 5508, '<td valign="top">Jesus Christ!</td>', 'Jesus Christ!', '2005-07-22 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555025, 205532, 30605, '<td valign="top">Simple yet, effective.</td>', 'Simple yet, effective.', '2005-07-22 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555026, 205256, 32893, '<td valign="top">Nice color and DOF.  Focus is great.  Nice image.</td>', 'Nice color and DOF.  Focus is great.  Nice image.', '2005-07-22 14:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555027, 206408, 30061, '<td valign="top">Of the many elephant shots I''ve seen thus far, this one has the most interesting composition.  I can''t decide if I like it or not.  I think I like it.  :o)  Great texture!</td>', 'Of the many elephant shots I''ve seen thus far, this one has the most interesting composition.  I can''t decide if I like it or not.  I think I like it.  :o)  Great texture!', '2005-07-22 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555028, 204955, 5508, '<td valign="top">Looks like a blanket. Good texture</td>', 'Looks like a blanket. Good texture', '2005-07-22 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555029, 204688, 3569, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Eastern Screech Owl.  Nice in all ways</td>', 'Wonderful Eastern Screech Owl.  Nice in all ways', '2005-07-22 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555031, 203369, 30061, '<td valign="top">The foot here is so blurry that I can''t see any texture in it, which makes me wonder why it was necessary to include it in the shot at all.  If the background were carpet or a rug, perhaps I could see it, but in the end I''m just left asking, "Why?".  5</td>', 'The foot here is so blurry that I can''t see any texture in it, which makes me wonder why it was necessary to include it in the shot at all.  If the background were carpet or a rug, perhaps I could see it, but in the end I''m just left asking, "Why?".  5', '2005-07-22 14:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555032, 204507, 32893, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Just enough tint; good focus; nice crop.  Lots of texture variance yet still a picture!</td>', 'Great photo!  Just enough tint; good focus; nice crop.  Lots of texture variance yet still a picture!', '2005-07-22 14:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555037, 206388, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful fir cone, shading is great</td>', 'wonderful fir cone, shading is great', '2005-07-22 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555039, 204733, 5508, '<td valign="top">These are ugly animals. Great texture.</td>', 'These are ugly animals. Great texture.', '2005-07-22 14:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555041, 205549, 30061, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this shot is of - some sort of fur, according to the title - but I don''t see any artistic point of view or even good clear focus to tell me what I''m looking at or, more importantly, why I''m looking at it.  4</td>', 'I have no idea what this shot is of - some sort of fur, according to the title - but I don''t see any artistic point of view or even good clear focus to tell me what I''m looking at or, more importantly, why I''m looking at it.  4', '2005-07-22 14:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555042, 203975, 32893, '<td valign="top">Pretty small image but nice.  Good contrast.  Good DOF.</td>', 'Pretty small image but nice.  Good contrast.  Good DOF.', '2005-07-22 14:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555043, 206451, 3569, '<td valign="top">:)  I love adobe.  Nice shot Cousin</td>', ':)  I love adobe.  Nice shot Cousin', '2005-07-22 14:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555044, 205472, 30061, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a couple other rubber-band shots, but I like this one the best.  Good color, shadowing, and composition.  7</td>', 'I''ve seen a couple other rubber-band shots, but I like this one the best.  Good color, shadowing, and composition.  7', '2005-07-22 14:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555049, 206401, 30605, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time identifying what it is. Too much contrast between blown highlight part and pitch black part.</td>', 'I have a hard time identifying what it is. Too much contrast between blown highlight part and pitch black part.', '2005-07-22 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555050, 206487, 32893, '<td valign="top">Image tilted left a bit?  Nice DOF and color.  Framing might be improved using rule of thirds.  Very nice.</td>', 'Image tilted left a bit?  Nice DOF and color.  Framing might be improved using rule of thirds.  Very nice.', '2005-07-22 14:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555052, 206051, 30061, '<td valign="top">This seems like an odd shot...I understand that the candy (I assume it''s candy from the color) is textured, but I can''t tell what it''s attached to, or why it''s attached to it in the first place.   5</td>', 'This seems like an odd shot...I understand that the candy (I assume it''s candy from the color) is textured, but I can''t tell what it''s attached to, or why it''s attached to it in the first place.   5', '2005-07-22 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555053, 203538, 30605, '<td valign="top">Very colorfull. Simple composition and good lighting.</td>', 'Very colorfull. Simple composition and good lighting.', '2005-07-22 14:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555055, 203623, 32893, '<td valign="top">Focus a bit off.  Nice color and framing.</td>', 'Focus a bit off.  Nice color and framing.', '2005-07-22 14:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555057, 206336, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, very fitting for the challenge and I get a real sense of history from the building.</td>', 'Nice, very fitting for the challenge and I get a real sense of history from the building.', '2005-07-22 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555059, 204881, 3569, '<td valign="top">the back ground needs to modify the teasel, next time cut the weed and move it to a different background that highlights the flower head.</td>', 'the back ground needs to modify the teasel, next time cut the weed and move it to a different background that highlights the flower head.', '2005-07-22 14:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555060, 206290, 32893, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the contrast in color.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the contrast in color.', '2005-07-22 14:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555062, 203754, 3569, '<td valign="top">I wonderful shot.  The feather in mouth makes the shot.</td>', 'I wonderful shot.  The feather in mouth makes the shot.', '2005-07-22 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555063, 206547, 3569, '<td valign="top">to grainy for me</td>', 'to grainy for me', '2005-07-22 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555064, 204143, 32893, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Nice color saturation.  Great DOF.</td>', 'Great image!  Nice color saturation.  Great DOF.', '2005-07-22 14:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555067, 206282, 32893, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rose!  Tremendous saturation.</td>', 'Beautiful rose!  Tremendous saturation.', '2005-07-22 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555068, 206086, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on what I presume is your new baby.  The shot is very nice, high key works well here and very fitting for the challenge.  I don´t get the composition though and it doesn´t appeal to me to have that much empty space on the right side and bottom and IMHO it decreases the impact of the shot but other than that, very nice.</td>', 'Congratulations on what I presume is your new baby.  The shot is very nice, high key works well here and very fitting for the challenge.  I don´t get the composition though and it doesn´t appeal to me to have that much empty space on the right side and bottom and IMHO it decreases the impact of the shot but other than that, very nice.', '2005-07-22 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555071, 204160, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit more contrast needed to me</td>', 'a bit more contrast needed to me', '2005-07-22 14:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555072, 205802, 32893, '<td valign="top">Excellent mix of texture types.  Good DOF and focus.  Love the beads of water on the needles.</td>', 'Excellent mix of texture types.  Good DOF and focus.  Love the beads of water on the needles.', '2005-07-22 14:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555078, 205745, 3569, '<td valign="top">the foreground left rock is distracting the shot to me</td>', 'the foreground left rock is distracting the shot to me', '2005-07-22 14:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555079, 206382, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=2<br/> <br/>VERY NICE.  I love your setup, it helps the eyes move around the photo.  Your lighitng is wonderful, made me think of going up the steps into heaven where the light is so pure and perfect.  Great job.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=2 VERY NICE.  I love your setup, it helps the eyes move around the photo.  Your lighitng is wonderful, made me think of going up the steps into heaven where the light is so pure and perfect.  Great job. Good luck', '2005-07-22 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555080, 206196, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Would make a good desktop image, but I''m not a fan of the border.</td>', 'Nice image.  Would make a good desktop image, but I''m not a fan of the border.', '2005-07-22 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555081, 204082, 27482, '<td valign="top">The white studio backround isn´t adding anything interesting to the shot IMHO, I think I would have preferred to see the piece of driftwood in it´s natural surroundings.  The lighting is also a bit too harsh for my taste but other than that pretty good, technically it´s ok, very sharp and it works well to have this B/W.</td>', 'The white studio backround isn´t adding anything interesting to the shot IMHO, I think I would have preferred to see the piece of driftwood in it´s natural surroundings.  The lighting is also a bit too harsh for my taste but other than that pretty good, technically it´s ok, very sharp and it works well to have this B/W.', '2005-07-22 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555082, 205199, 32893, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Levels would help.  Better DOF would improve the image.</td>', 'Too dark.  Levels would help.  Better DOF would improve the image.', '2005-07-22 14:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555083, 204224, 32893, '<td valign="top">More unsharp.  Very good.</td>', 'More unsharp.  Very good.', '2005-07-22 14:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555084, 206445, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed on the upper yellowish feathers to me</td>', 'a bit overexposed on the upper yellowish feathers to me', '2005-07-22 14:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555085, 204041, 32893, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit of focus.</td>', 'Needs a bit of focus.', '2005-07-22 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555086, 205943, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful lighting</td>', 'wonderful lighting', '2005-07-22 14:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555087, 205699, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1<br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1<br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>Simple yet very nice.  I tried to do a similar shot of some small work boots I found in a forgotten doorway but didn''t have even a tiny bit of your style to it.  You can almost see the dry rot in the boots, they look as if they would crack to pieces if you touch them.  Wonderful background....is that a studio drop? WOW.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1Attractiveness=1  Simple yet very nice.  I tried to do a similar shot of some small work boots I found in a forgotten doorway but didn''t have even a tiny bit of your style to it.  You can almost see the dry rot in the boots, they look as if they would crack to pieces if you touch them.  Wonderful background....is that a studio drop? WOW. Good luck', '2005-07-22 14:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555089, 205730, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t know about this one, I both love it and hate it.  I hate the sky, it is an odd mint green phenomenon that I have never seen myself so that is a big drawback in the shot for me personally.  I love the rest of the shot though, the texture and colour on the tree is awesome and the shape is very interesting, looks like the tree has some history and it looks very peaceful, I wouldn´t mind having a picknick under that tree.  The brown/green grass complements the tree perfectly and the brown hill in the backround ties it all together.  I gave this shot an 8 and I would have given it a perfect 10 if the sky had been a deep blue colour.  Great job!</td>', 'I don´t know about this one, I both love it and hate it.  I hate the sky, it is an odd mint green phenomenon that I have never seen myself so that is a big drawback in the shot for me personally.  I love the rest of the shot though, the texture and colour on the tree is awesome and the shape is very interesting, looks like the tree has some history and it looks very peaceful, I wouldn´t mind having a picknick under that tree.  The brown/green grass complements the tree perfectly and the brown hill in the backround ties it all together.  I gave this shot an 8 and I would have given it a perfect 10 if the sky had been a deep blue colour.  Great job!', '2005-07-22 14:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555090, 205730, 39243, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. your manipulation of the photo does TEXTURES justice. 7</td>', 'This is pretty cool. your manipulation of the photo does TEXTURES justice. 7', '2005-07-22 14:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555092, 205532, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>I just mentioned in the last picture I voted on that it looked like the boots would fall apart if you touch them from their age but wow, you''ve even gotten a better one.  I like the close up and angled setup you have here.  You probably could have shot the entire boot and saw the textures but this and its color adds impact.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=1  I just mentioned in the last picture I voted on that it looked like the boots would fall apart if you touch them from their age but wow, you''ve even gotten a better one.  I like the close up and angled setup you have here.  You probably could have shot the entire boot and saw the textures but this and its color adds impact. Good luck', '2005-07-22 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555093, 203410, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit unoriginal but the best leaf shot I have seen so far this challenge, technically it´s extremely well done, especially with lighting.  8 from me.</td>', 'A bit unoriginal but the best leaf shot I have seen so far this challenge, technically it´s extremely well done, especially with lighting.  8 from me.', '2005-07-22 14:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555094, 206300, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed to me, but a beautiful shot anyway.</td>', 'a bit overexposed to me, but a beautiful shot anyway.', '2005-07-22 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555095, 204987, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems in focus...</td>', 'Nothing seems in focus...', '2005-07-22 14:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555097, 205199, 3569, '<td valign="top">a fuzzy mushroom, excellent.  Nice capture too.</td>', 'a fuzzy mushroom, excellent.  Nice capture too.', '2005-07-22 14:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555098, 206084, 27158, '<td valign="top">nice colors, good focus...the composition doesn''t do much for me - dark area at top is distracting</td>', 'nice colors, good focus...the composition doesn''t do much for me - dark area at top is distracting', '2005-07-22 14:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555100, 206394, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>I think I would have preferred to see either all the words on the balls or none at all.  Nice setup and your background adds a nice touch, though its a little dirty in the center and lower right.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  I think I would have preferred to see either all the words on the balls or none at all.  Nice setup and your background adds a nice touch, though its a little dirty in the center and lower right. Good luck', '2005-07-22 14:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555102, 206291, 27158, '<td valign="top">interesting...nice textures - find the composition a bit off.</td>', 'interesting...nice textures - find the composition a bit off.', '2005-07-22 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555105, 203583, 9964, '<td valign="top">nice dof to bring out the texture</td>', 'nice dof to bring out the texture', '2005-07-22 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555106, 206414, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>So lets see...you got elegance texture in the curtains, old texture in the flower pot and window frame and soft yet independant texture in the cat.  Looks like you''ve met the topic very nicely.  I love the tones.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1  So lets see...you got elegance texture in the curtains, old texture in the flower pot and window frame and soft yet independant texture in the cat.  Looks like you''ve met the topic very nicely.  I love the tones. Good luck', '2005-07-22 14:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555107, 206549, 27158, '<td valign="top">fun photo with lots of emotive value. Connection to challenge a bit far fetched, but nice focus, color and exposure.</td>', 'fun photo with lots of emotive value. Connection to challenge a bit far fetched, but nice focus, color and exposure.', '2005-07-22 14:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555109, 206072, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>Nice variety of textures here.  Colors seem just a slight bit dull but nothing major. Love the positioning.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  Nice variety of textures here.  Colors seem just a slight bit dull but nothing major. Love the positioning. Good luck', '2005-07-22 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1);
