(1555115, 206376, 27158, '<td valign="top">I like this composition and the colors are nice and rich - though the highlight is a bit burned. I would have liked a bit sharper focus on the egg - the foreground seems sharper. nice textures</td>', 'I like this composition and the colors are nice and rich - though the highlight is a bit burned. I would have liked a bit sharper focus on the egg - the foreground seems sharper. nice textures', '2005-07-22 14:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
