(1555288, 205986, 21714, '<td valign="top">On DPC, the smaller images are always voted down. If you don''t make the longest side at least 640px or something close to that, your chances of getting a good score is unlikely. I am sure that if the same image presented bigger would do much better. Bigger the image, closer we are able to look at it and observe the detail. This image is about detail.</td>', 'On DPC, the smaller images are always voted down. If you don''t make the longest side at least 640px or something close to that, your chances of getting a good score is unlikely. I am sure that if the same image presented bigger would do much better. Bigger the image, closer we are able to look at it and observe the detail. This image is about detail.', '2005-07-22 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
