(1555406, 206557, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very crafty!  I''d like to see a different background with this.  The table reflected and made a bit of a hot spot and the black edges are a little distracting.</td>', 'Very crafty!  I''d like to see a different background with this.  The table reflected and made a bit of a hot spot and the black edges are a little distracting.', '2005-07-22 16:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
