(1555418, 204612, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great forms and nice view of the contextual environment. I''d perhaps like to see a slightly higher viewpoint with the camera much closer to the rocks. If shot with a tripod and longish exposure you could have achieved an amazing DOF which would have made this a stunner.</td>', 'Great forms and nice view of the contextual environment. I''d perhaps like to see a slightly higher viewpoint with the camera much closer to the rocks. If shot with a tripod and longish exposure you could have achieved an amazing DOF which would have made this a stunner.', '2005-07-22 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555420, 203415, 35947, '<td valign="top">You got something on your lip there!  Very colorful image!</td>', 'You got something on your lip there!  Very colorful image!', '2005-07-22 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555427, 206311, 30605, '<td valign="top">Too many blown highlight in here.</td>', 'Too many blown highlight in here.', '2005-07-22 16:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555431, 205144, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely looking tree indeed. Very striking. The image looks very soft though (handheld - no tripod) so this is something I would rely on for a shot where there isn''t much light.<br/> <br/>If I were taking this I might try to get very low and close to the tree roots, shoot in portrait and look upawards at the trunk with a very long DOF (focusing on the trunk with at least f8). This would give a great view of the textures both near and far. <br/> <br/>As it stands your comp is OK, but I would have lost the bright background with the person showing.</td>', 'Lovely looking tree indeed. Very striking. The image looks very soft though (handheld - no tripod) so this is something I would rely on for a shot where there isn''t much light. If I were taking this I might try to get very low and close to the tree roots, shoot in portrait and look upawards at the trunk with a very long DOF (focusing on the trunk with at least f8). This would give a great view of the textures both near and far.  As it stands your comp is OK, but I would have lost the bright background with the person showing.', '2005-07-22 16:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555450, 206225, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene and composition - surely a high placer. Some pleasant texture visible obviously especially in the near rock  and moss on the watefall lip. Should end up with a good few faves!</td>', 'Wonderful scene and composition - surely a high placer. Some pleasant texture visible obviously especially in the near rock  and moss on the watefall lip. Should end up with a good few faves!', '2005-07-22 16:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
