(1556495, 206041, 7304, '<td valign="top">Cool Croc. The texture of the skin looks leathery.</td>', 'Cool Croc. The texture of the skin looks leathery.', '2005-07-23 02:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556497, 205040, 7304, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The red leaf goes well with the wicker basket. The texture grabs you.</td>', 'Beautiful. The red leaf goes well with the wicker basket. The texture grabs you.', '2005-07-23 02:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556499, 204627, 7304, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and geat clarity and color.</td>', 'Excellent capture and geat clarity and color.', '2005-07-23 02:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556501, 204473, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice. Same one who did the owl? Nice clarity and a unique cropping of the image.</td>', 'Nice. Same one who did the owl? Nice clarity and a unique cropping of the image.', '2005-07-23 02:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556518, 204575, 37252, '<td valign="top">this looks to be a little over-sharpened. By shooting this macro, you leave me to think the deers fur is bristly like a porcupine - but on the contrary, it is soft. A close-up could have shown this without going to the extreme of macro. Sometimes macro causes the texture to seem harsher than it truly is.</td>', 'this looks to be a little over-sharpened. By shooting this macro, you leave me to think the deers fur is bristly like a porcupine - but on the contrary, it is soft. A close-up could have shown this without going to the extreme of macro. Sometimes macro causes the texture to seem harsher than it truly is.', '2005-07-23 02:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556556, 205346, 41115, '<td valign="top">At first glance, the implied texture is sharp and prickly, but then you realize they''re actually soft light feathers. That''s a nice irony.  I wonder if a B/W treatment would be better... (voted 9)</td>', 'At first glance, the implied texture is sharp and prickly, but then you realize they''re actually soft light feathers. That''s a nice irony.  I wonder if a B/W treatment would be better... (voted 9)', '2005-07-23 03:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556564, 206287, 41115, '<td valign="top">IMHO, a bit more DOF so more details from the background could''ve come in would be nicer. Also, a background that also lends itself to texture but does not distract. You got the texture theme from the rope, but what makes this a 9 for me is that the knots imply strength in bonds/ ties. Also the frayed character of the rope conveys the strain caused by the tension/ tautness of these connections.<br/>Or am I projecting my subconscious/ problems like a Rorschach Test?<br/>LOL. It''s easy to critique, harder to submit.<br/>Good work. Hope you place high.</td>', 'IMHO, a bit more DOF so more details from the background could''ve come in would be nicer. Also, a background that also lends itself to texture but does not distract. You got the texture theme from the rope, but what makes this a 9 for me is that the knots imply strength in bonds/ ties. Also the frayed character of the rope conveys the strain caused by the tension/ tautness of these connections.Or am I projecting my subconscious/ problems like a Rorschach Test?LOL. It''s easy to critique, harder to submit.Good work. Hope you place high.', '2005-07-23 03:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556586, 206465, 31403, '<td valign="top">the seam in the wall is unfortunate, closer cropping, or rotate it 90 counter clock and keep the light to the left third might make a nice compostition - it''s a great idea, and I think with just a little post work I would like this a lot more - 6</td>', 'the seam in the wall is unfortunate, closer cropping, or rotate it 90 counter clock and keep the light to the left third might make a nice compostition - it''s a great idea, and I think with just a little post work I would like this a lot more - 6', '2005-07-23 04:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556590, 205942, 31403, '<td valign="top">lines leading my eye in every direction.  very visually confusing and lacks focus compositionally - really cool textures, they just need to be the main  subject</td>', 'lines leading my eye in every direction.  very visually confusing and lacks focus compositionally - really cool textures, they just need to be the main  subject', '2005-07-23 04:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556596, 205928, 31403, '<td valign="top">technically excellent - some color with the texture would make me like it more</td>', 'technically excellent - some color with the texture would make me like it more', '2005-07-23 04:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556598, 205633, 31403, '<td valign="top">very nice, who knew wax had texture - I love it - framing and exposure top notch, really nice work</td>', 'very nice, who knew wax had texture - I love it - framing and exposure top notch, really nice work', '2005-07-23 04:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556600, 203629, 31403, '<td valign="top">really cool concept, I''d like to see it with more dramatic lighting - often easier said than done, I know.</td>', 'really cool concept, I''d like to see it with more dramatic lighting - often easier said than done, I know.', '2005-07-23 04:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
