(1556696, 206152, 39339, '<td valign="top">lavendar''s green...when you are king...great, now that song will be in my head all day!  wonderful shot.  great color, amazing composition.  i really hope this places!!!  10!</td>', 'lavendar''s green...when you are king...great, now that song will be in my head all day!  wonderful shot.  great color, amazing composition.  i really hope this places!!!  10!', '2005-07-23 06:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556701, 204611, 39339, '<td valign="top">i think this is a great, unique shot.  i really wish more of the log were in focus so that the mushrooms/fungus on the bottom part were in focus as well (but this is just a personal pref.).</td>', 'i think this is a great, unique shot.  i really wish more of the log were in focus so that the mushrooms/fungus on the bottom part were in focus as well (but this is just a personal pref.).', '2005-07-23 06:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556709, 205632, 39339, '<td valign="top">i love this photo -- love your tight crop/composition, and the texture on these old chucks is incredible...i never realized they had so much texture. 10</td>', 'i love this photo -- love your tight crop/composition, and the texture on these old chucks is incredible...i never realized they had so much texture. 10', '2005-07-23 06:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556710, 206284, 39339, '<td valign="top">i think you have a great concept for the texture...i think you could really make this better if you choose a different angle to shoot it -- maybe a different position of the egg or a closer crop so that the egg isn''t dead center on the photo.</td>', 'i think you have a great concept for the texture...i think you could really make this better if you choose a different angle to shoot it -- maybe a different position of the egg or a closer crop so that the egg isn''t dead center on the photo.', '2005-07-23 06:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556733, 203646, 30364, '<td valign="top">Another nice image featuring this very good model; she swaps her chains for bricks!  It was an inspired idea to have her feeling the texture of bricks like this, especially with such a captivated expression on her face... it makes your texture image into something special.  You don''t just show the texture, you show us what it feels like.  That''s two very fine &amp; creative challenge interpretations in a row!  8</td>', 'Another nice image featuring this very good model; she swaps her chains for bricks!  It was an inspired idea to have her feeling the texture of bricks like this, especially with such a captivated expression on her face... it makes your texture image into something special.  You don''t just show the texture, you show us what it feels like.  That''s two very fine & creative challenge interpretations in a row!  8', '2005-07-23 07:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556734, 204162, 30364, '<td valign="top">Excellent image of the end less travelled of this elephant.  The photograph is not quite technically immaculate (a shortcoming I actually like), but the texture is great and it''s an original point-of-view.  7</td>', 'Excellent image of the end less travelled of this elephant.  The photograph is not quite technically immaculate (a shortcoming I actually like), but the texture is great and it''s an original point-of-view.  7', '2005-07-23 07:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
