(1557399, 206441, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think your depth of field may have been too shallow on this one.  Perhaps a higher f stop.  Also the macro made the image grainy.  If it was shot with a very large file size, maybe reducing the file size at the time the shot is taken will help.</td>', 'I think your depth of field may have been too shallow on this one.  Perhaps a higher f stop.  Also the macro made the image grainy.  If it was shot with a very large file size, maybe reducing the file size at the time the shot is taken will help.', '2005-07-23 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
