(1557410, 206491, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The contrast of mask and feathers compliment each other well.  Maybe a sharper focus if at all possible would have really brought out the feather texture.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The contrast of mask and feathers compliment each other well.  Maybe a sharper focus if at all possible would have really brought out the feather texture.', '2005-07-23 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
