(1557610, 206383, 24330, '<td valign="top">good focus on wood, attracts the eye, a little soft on leaf, makes the leaf a secondary element.<br/>Make your primary subject the focus point and let the background go.<br/>leaf needs turning more upright to bring the top into the third rule.<br/>would have left the leaf on a twig, it looks kinda lonely.<br/>try using a mirror to direct the light/ shade if outside. good luck</td>', 'good focus on wood, attracts the eye, a little soft on leaf, makes the leaf a secondary element.Make your primary subject the focus point and let the background go.leaf needs turning more upright to bring the top into the third rule.would have left the leaf on a twig, it looks kinda lonely.try using a mirror to direct the light/ shade if outside. good luck', '2005-07-23 19:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
