(1558470, 203517, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific textures and a simple but effective composition.  The sideways point-of-view somehow adds interest.  Belt''s been taken in a notch recently ... alas, mine''s heading the other way.  7</td>', 'Terrific textures and a simple but effective composition.  The sideways point-of-view somehow adds interest.  Belt''s been taken in a notch recently ... alas, mine''s heading the other way.  7', '2005-07-24 06:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
