(1558798, 204824, 30061, '<td valign="top">Cute idea...  I wish the table/desk didn''t drop off at the top of the shot, though.  Cute lamb!</td>', 'Cute idea...  I wish the table/desk didn''t drop off at the top of the shot, though.  Cute lamb!', '2005-07-24 13:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
