(1558800, 206055, 30061, '<td valign="top">Eww...it really does look like brains.  :o)  Cool texture!</td>', 'Eww...it really does look like brains.  :o)  Cool texture!', '2005-07-24 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558803, 205946, 30061, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Personally, I think the impact would have been better in black &amp; white - to show the character of the wood better.  But I really like the composition!</td>', 'I really like this.  Personally, I think the impact would have been better in black & white - to show the character of the wood better.  But I really like the composition!', '2005-07-24 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558805, 206423, 30061, '<td valign="top">Is this your foot?</td>', 'Is this your foot?', '2005-07-24 13:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558806, 206463, 36882, '<td valign="top">this photo freaked me out when i first saw it but  a real good photo well done</td>', 'this photo freaked me out when i first saw it but  a real good photo well done', '2005-07-24 13:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558838, 206570, 36199, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see this image much larger and also perhaps in colour, as it is it the dark tone masks what would be very detailed texture.</td>', 'Would have loved to see this image much larger and also perhaps in colour, as it is it the dark tone masks what would be very detailed texture.', '2005-07-24 14:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558840, 203394, 36199, '<td valign="top">nice compositon and colour but the lack of sharpness on the right make the texture look indistinct</td>', 'nice compositon and colour but the lack of sharpness on the right make the texture look indistinct', '2005-07-24 14:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558844, 206394, 36199, '<td valign="top">good composition, i like the contrast with the backing material, if you had got the pattern between the balls and the material perfectly symetrical i would have given a 9, as that would have worked better for me, but that is purely my opinion- therefore 8</td>', 'good composition, i like the contrast with the backing material, if you had got the pattern between the balls and the material perfectly symetrical i would have given a 9, as that would have worked better for me, but that is purely my opinion- therefore 8', '2005-07-24 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558845, 205696, 36199, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, i love the lighting</td>', 'beautiful shot, i love the lighting', '2005-07-24 14:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558847, 205891, 36199, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour, and good lighting, i would justhave liked a deeper DOF. I can almost feel the texture on the buds!</td>', 'beautiful colour, and good lighting, i would justhave liked a deeper DOF. I can almost feel the texture on the buds!', '2005-07-24 14:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558848, 205532, 39483, '<td valign="top">One of the best pics of the challenge...Wonderful texture and nice depth of field (although in my opinion, having more of the shoe in focus, either more of the lace area or more of the front tear would increase the texture feel even more?) <br/>But even the bit of ground adds to the gritty feel!<br/>Very well done. I hope you score high!</td>', 'One of the best pics of the challenge...Wonderful texture and nice depth of field (although in my opinion, having more of the shoe in focus, either more of the lace area or more of the front tear would increase the texture feel even more?) But even the bit of ground adds to the gritty feel!Very well done. I hope you score high!', '2005-07-24 14:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558850, 205807, 39483, '<td valign="top">After a second look, I''m bumping it a point more! Wonderful water drop texture and colors! This depth of focus gives the photo a lot of dimensions, in addition to the ripples of petals weaving in and out of the picture.<br/>well done. I hope you get in the top ten!</td>', 'After a second look, I''m bumping it a point more! Wonderful water drop texture and colors! This depth of focus gives the photo a lot of dimensions, in addition to the ripples of petals weaving in and out of the picture.well done. I hope you get in the top ten!', '2005-07-24 14:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558853, 203848, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great angle and depth of field. The bits of pixalation and over sharpening (?) detract a bit from the beauty and simplicity of this photo. Very original and amazing composition! well done.</td>', 'Great angle and depth of field. The bits of pixalation and over sharpening (?) detract a bit from the beauty and simplicity of this photo. Very original and amazing composition! well done.', '2005-07-24 14:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558859, 206540, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great texture and depth of field! I like the composition and the details of the cracking outer and inner layers of the peanuts. Nice colors too...</td>', 'Great texture and depth of field! I like the composition and the details of the cracking outer and inner layers of the peanuts. Nice colors too...', '2005-07-24 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558863, 206348, 39339, '<td valign="top">wonderful texture!!!  i really love the colors/tones in this!!!</td>', 'wonderful texture!!!  i really love the colors/tones in this!!!', '2005-07-24 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558865, 206015, 39483, '<td valign="top">great close up and texture! You can even see and feel the texture on the gums and enamel. Well done, you made a hard photo to take look so effortless (great lighting, colors, focus...). Good luck!</td>', 'great close up and texture! You can even see and feel the texture on the gums and enamel. Well done, you made a hard photo to take look so effortless (great lighting, colors, focus...). Good luck!', '2005-07-24 14:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558867, 205897, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the original subject and the simple and uncluttered composition. A different orientation of the light might have made the flesh of the fruit look more transluscent and appealing? Great texture though!</td>', 'I like the original subject and the simple and uncluttered composition. A different orientation of the light might have made the flesh of the fruit look more transluscent and appealing? Great texture though!', '2005-07-24 14:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558870, 206083, 36078, '<td valign="top">I knew someone would have the same idea as me.  Atleast mine is a different brand =).  Nice DOF and nice lighting I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I knew someone would have the same idea as me.  Atleast mine is a different brand =).  Nice DOF and nice lighting I gave it a 7.', '2005-07-24 14:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558872, 206496, 32767, '<td valign="top">Interesting crimson sunset but I''d have to say a bit oversaturated for my personal taste</td>', 'Interesting crimson sunset but I''d have to say a bit oversaturated for my personal taste', '2005-07-24 14:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558874, 203847, 39483, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compostion and depth of field! I love the zebra in the background looking at the viewer! But the foreground is what makes it textured...and it''s well done also. A bit more of the spiky hair on the left side might have added even more texture?</td>', 'Wonderful compostion and depth of field! I love the zebra in the background looking at the viewer! But the foreground is what makes it textured...and it''s well done also. A bit more of the spiky hair on the left side might have added even more texture?', '2005-07-24 14:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
