(1559336, 206441, 14736, '<td valign="top">this photo has a grainy, over-sharpened look to it that doesn''t work for me.  i do like the composition and the shallow depth of field, but i would have liked it a little less shallow. overall good job</td>', 'this photo has a grainy, over-sharpened look to it that doesn''t work for me.  i do like the composition and the shallow depth of field, but i would have liked it a little less shallow. overall good job', '2005-07-24 20:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
