(1559391, 203646, 14736, '<td valign="top">excellent photo, i really like the choice of black and white.  the biggest problem, for me, is that while the girl can surely feel the texture of those bricks, i can''t.  i also think that her skin and shirt used to have more texture before neatimage got ahold of them.  i really wouldn''t change anything technically or compositionally for this photo, as a photo in general, just maybe to fare better in this challenge.</td>', 'excellent photo, i really like the choice of black and white.  the biggest problem, for me, is that while the girl can surely feel the texture of those bricks, i can''t.  i also think that her skin and shirt used to have more texture before neatimage got ahold of them.  i really wouldn''t change anything technically or compositionally for this photo, as a photo in general, just maybe to fare better in this challenge.', '2005-07-24 20:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559392, 206191, 39349, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for this photo, good job!</td>', 'Cool idea for this photo, good job!', '2005-07-24 20:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559393, 206282, 14736, '<td valign="top">very nice rose shot, maybe the best of the challenge, but i think more sharpness could only help here.</td>', 'very nice rose shot, maybe the best of the challenge, but i think more sharpness could only help here.', '2005-07-24 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559395, 204245, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice detail of the surface of the moon. Not much texture in the photo but I''m sure that''s hard being on Earth and all. ;D 7</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice detail of the surface of the moon. Not much texture in the photo but I''m sure that''s hard being on Earth and all. ;D 7', '2005-07-24 20:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
