(1559407, 204802, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a classic car, wonderful texture on the radiator grill. Little blur on the wire loom left of the headlight but that is really all I can find wrong in the pic. 9</td>', 'Great shot of a classic car, wonderful texture on the radiator grill. Little blur on the wire loom left of the headlight but that is really all I can find wrong in the pic. 9', '2005-07-24 20:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
