(1559576, 206411, 23962, '<td valign="top">I haven''t commented much in this challenge. Ihis shot of yours is inspiring. It covers all the bases. You must be happy with it. High marks.</td>', 'I haven''t commented much in this challenge. Ihis shot of yours is inspiring. It covers all the bases. You must be happy with it. High marks.', '2005-07-24 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559578, 206225, 23962, '<td valign="top">The first water shot that i have seen that fits the challenge descriptiopn. And a beautifull shot with nice balance and colour.</td>', 'The first water shot that i have seen that fits the challenge descriptiopn. And a beautifull shot with nice balance and colour.', '2005-07-24 22:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559582, 206354, 5508, '<td valign="top">nice colour</td>', 'nice colour', '2005-07-24 22:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559589, 206547, 5508, '<td valign="top">Too grainy, nice photo though</td>', 'Too grainy, nice photo though', '2005-07-24 22:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559596, 205948, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great shot...</td>', 'Great shot...', '2005-07-24 23:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559630, 204245, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. Is this Afocal? PrimeFocus or EP Projection.</td>', 'Great Shot. Is this Afocal? PrimeFocus or EP Projection.', '2005-07-24 23:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559654, 206534, 13749, '<td valign="top">Wow. Amazing.  out of about 40 that i''ve seen, I''d say that this has invoked the strongest feeling of texture so far. i like the black in the corners - nice job.</td>', 'Wow. Amazing.  out of about 40 that i''ve seen, I''d say that this has invoked the strongest feeling of texture so far. i like the black in the corners - nice job.', '2005-07-24 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559668, 205904, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting perspective and angle on this shot.  Nice colors, although there is a bit of a glare.  Unusual and creative entry.</td>', 'I like the interesting perspective and angle on this shot.  Nice colors, although there is a bit of a glare.  Unusual and creative entry.', '2005-07-24 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559671, 206414, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think the title draws too much attention away from the numerous good textures in this shot.  It''s a good shot - could be a little sharper - but nice composition.</td>', 'I think the title draws too much attention away from the numerous good textures in this shot.  It''s a good shot - could be a little sharper - but nice composition.', '2005-07-24 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559679, 203464, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a really great photo.  Unfortunately, I think it currently could use a little work on lighting, color and DOF.  The lighting is a bit harsh, causing a glare.  The angle of the shot is interesting, but because of the crop it is difficult for the viewer to get his/her bearings right away - you might try moving the tree trunk out of the center of the shot.  The textures of the bark are great.</td>', 'I think this could be a really great photo.  Unfortunately, I think it currently could use a little work on lighting, color and DOF.  The lighting is a bit harsh, causing a glare.  The angle of the shot is interesting, but because of the crop it is difficult for the viewer to get his/her bearings right away - you might try moving the tree trunk out of the center of the shot.  The textures of the bark are great.', '2005-07-24 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559683, 203517, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  I like the composition (and everyone knows what leather belts and jeans feel like) - it meets the challenge well.  I like the composition and crop.  It may sound strange, but I think that if the jeans were more "worn" and/or included a rattier feel, this image would score higher with voters.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  I like the composition (and everyone knows what leather belts and jeans feel like) - it meets the challenge well.  I like the composition and crop.  It may sound strange, but I think that if the jeans were more "worn" and/or included a rattier feel, this image would score higher with voters.', '2005-07-24 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559689, 206269, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good cactus shot, but I think the fact that it''s so centered in the frame that it doesn''t lend itself to being as interesting as it could be.  You might want to try a different crop to add something to the shot.  Still a good photo - pretty good sharpness and color.</td>', 'Good cactus shot, but I think the fact that it''s so centered in the frame that it doesn''t lend itself to being as interesting as it could be.  You might want to try a different crop to add something to the shot.  Still a good photo - pretty good sharpness and color.', '2005-07-24 23:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559692, 205068, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I think the lighting is a little harsh, causing you to lose some detail (especially given the mushroom''s naturally light color).  You''ve got good DOF and I like the composition (&amp; border).</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I think the lighting is a little harsh, causing you to lose some detail (especially given the mushroom''s naturally light color).  You''ve got good DOF and I like the composition (& border).', '2005-07-24 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559697, 206177, 34659, '<td valign="top">IMHO<br/>What doesn''t work: color is drab, lighting is harsh, background should be uniform, crop could be more interesting (get it out of the dead center).  What works: tomato''s familiar textures, juiciness of the tomato, dark general background.</td>', 'IMHOWhat doesn''t work: color is drab, lighting is harsh, background should be uniform, crop could be more interesting (get it out of the dead center).  What works: tomato''s familiar textures, juiciness of the tomato, dark general background.', '2005-07-24 23:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559698, 205565, 21816, '<td valign="top">The focus looks a little soft on this to me.</td>', 'The focus looks a little soft on this to me.', '2005-07-24 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559702, 206035, 34659, '<td valign="top">IMHO<br/>What works: colors, composition, border.  What doesn''t work: no real "feel" of texture shown other than the dirty wrinkles in the fabric or paper (can''t even tell what the flag is made of).</td>', 'IMHOWhat works: colors, composition, border.  What doesn''t work: no real "feel" of texture shown other than the dirty wrinkles in the fabric or paper (can''t even tell what the flag is made of).', '2005-07-24 23:41:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1559707, 205898, 21816, '<td valign="top">Hey! This is a fantastic photo.....it looks a tiny bit soft to me and the light is a shade harsh on the shell but fascinating. Excellent!</td>', 'Hey! This is a fantastic photo.....it looks a tiny bit soft to me and the light is a shade harsh on the shell but fascinating. Excellent!', '2005-07-24 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559712, 206215, 21816, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo...well done!</td>', 'Beautiful photo...well done!', '2005-07-24 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559756, 206540, 40703, '<td valign="top">Details very sharp and easy on the eyes. There''s no distraction in the background. I give you a 9.</td>', 'Details very sharp and easy on the eyes. There''s no distraction in the background. I give you a 9.', '2005-07-25 00:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559774, 206335, 22551, '<td valign="top">Very vivid - the colors could be a bit more sharp but otherwise I like very much.</td>', 'Very vivid - the colors could be a bit more sharp but otherwise I like very much.', '2005-07-25 00:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559777, 206382, 40703, '<td valign="top">Very smexy B&amp;W shot. I really like the glowing corridors. I give you an 8.</td>', 'Very smexy B&W shot. I really like the glowing corridors. I give you an 8.', '2005-07-25 00:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559780, 206463, 40703, '<td valign="top">Kind of creepy...but...okay...<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Kind of creepy...but...okay... 6', '2005-07-25 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559784, 206549, 40703, '<td valign="top">Would have been more appealing (to me) if it was in B&amp;W. I give you a 6.</td>', 'Would have been more appealing (to me) if it was in B&W. I give you a 6.', '2005-07-25 00:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559791, 206302, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  I hope you had a good zoom for this. His head doesn''t seem perfectly sharp to me. Maybe it''s the camouflage of his scales.  I think I would have liked it without the blurred part of his body behind his head.  I find it as effective cropped just above the top of his head, where it is more clear.  I like the texture and detail of his body below the head. (shudder - I''m NOT a reptile lover)</td>', 'Yikes.  I hope you had a good zoom for this. His head doesn''t seem perfectly sharp to me. Maybe it''s the camouflage of his scales.  I think I would have liked it without the blurred part of his body behind his head.  I find it as effective cropped just above the top of his head, where it is more clear.  I like the texture and detail of his body below the head. (shudder - I''m NOT a reptile lover)', '2005-07-25 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559797, 205888, 15711, '<td valign="top">The green tones are so intense.  Interesting and definitely a textured surface.  Good macro although I think the spokes could be a bit more crisp.</td>', 'The green tones are so intense.  Interesting and definitely a textured surface.  Good macro although I think the spokes could be a bit more crisp.', '2005-07-25 00:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559798, 204668, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been more interesting could you see all of the armadillos head. That hint of eye makes me want to see more of it. It could use a touch of sharpening as well. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I think this might have been more interesting could you see all of the armadillos head. That hint of eye makes me want to see more of it. It could use a touch of sharpening as well. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-07-25 00:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559799, 203686, 19066, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and texture, but the stars distract...  Awesome shot without the "planet" gimmick.</td>', 'I like the lighting and texture, but the stars distract...  Awesome shot without the "planet" gimmick.', '2005-07-25 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559800, 205088, 41091, '<td valign="top">Iron rebar rightt?</td>', 'Iron rebar rightt?', '2005-07-25 00:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559803, 206301, 41091, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture here... what kinda camera is this?</td>', 'Wow, great capture here... what kinda camera is this?', '2005-07-25 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1559806, 204884, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the variations of tone between the cool of the gray and black against the warm of the brown and rust, but it''s a tad busy.  The focus is crisp. Maybe shot from a different angle??  I''m not sure.</td>', 'I like the variations of tone between the cool of the gray and black against the warm of the brown and rust, but it''s a tad busy.  The focus is crisp. Maybe shot from a different angle??  I''m not sure.', '2005-07-25 00:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
