(1560306, 206451, 18197, '<td valign="top">LOL! For a minute I thought this was a dig at Photoshop ... then I see real Adobe. What a hoot. Nice job with the textures.</td>', 'LOL! For a minute I thought this was a dig at Photoshop ... then I see real Adobe. What a hoot. Nice job with the textures.', '2005-07-25 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560317, 206084, 40546, '<td valign="top">Textures??</td>', 'Textures??', '2005-07-25 01:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560327, 205670, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge very well. I can "feel" the texture.</td>', 'Meets the challenge very well. I can "feel" the texture.', '2005-07-25 01:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560337, 206564, 18197, '<td valign="top">Several great textures represented here! Nicely composed. Good technical capture. Great job.</td>', 'Several great textures represented here! Nicely composed. Good technical capture. Great job.', '2005-07-25 01:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560338, 203847, 38911, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture and fits well with the theme!  It should do well. 8</td>', 'Interesting picture and fits well with the theme!  It should do well. 8', '2005-07-25 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560348, 204072, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Every detail is focused on and highlights texture. Elephants are hard to shoot because they rarely stand still. This is a wonderfully crisp capture but possibly a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Every detail is focused on and highlights texture. Elephants are hard to shoot because they rarely stand still. This is a wonderfully crisp capture but possibly a bit over sharpened.', '2005-07-25 01:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560351, 203650, 38911, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome picture and fits well with the theme! 8<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is an awesome picture and fits well with the theme! 8 ', '2005-07-25 01:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560354, 204087, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the subject too much but I have to give you credit, you did a very nice job capturing several textures well enough to "feel." Great job.</td>', 'I don''t care for the subject too much but I have to give you credit, you did a very nice job capturing several textures well enough to "feel." Great job.', '2005-07-25 01:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560359, 204072, 38911, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a few elephant pics but this is by far the best! Great texture. 9</td>', 'There seems to be a few elephant pics but this is by far the best! Great texture. 9', '2005-07-25 01:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560368, 205472, 38911, '<td valign="top">Great picture - Great minds think alike. 7</td>', 'Great picture - Great minds think alike. 7', '2005-07-25 01:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560375, 204245, 38911, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture.  Please post tech details on this. 8</td>', 'Awesome picture.  Please post tech details on this. 8', '2005-07-25 01:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560379, 206209, 18197, '<td valign="top">With a picture this small, it is hard to make out the detail Try to use all the pixels available to you ... 640 on a side.</td>', 'With a picture this small, it is hard to make out the detail Try to use all the pixels available to you ... 640 on a side.', '2005-07-25 01:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560394, 203649, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. I love the composition. I really like the gradations of light and shadow. It does a pretty good job of capturing texture. There are some who will not appreciate the grain inthe background. I happen to like it and believe it gives it character and captures a texture all its own. It looks to me like you may have dust on your sensor leading to quite a few artifacts which distract from this otherwise very worthy photo.</td>', 'This is very nice. I love the composition. I really like the gradations of light and shadow. It does a pretty good job of capturing texture. There are some who will not appreciate the grain inthe background. I happen to like it and believe it gives it character and captures a texture all its own. It looks to me like you may have dust on your sensor leading to quite a few artifacts which distract from this otherwise very worthy photo.', '2005-07-25 01:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560407, 203656, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I''m not sure that it''s a great example of texture but the creative idea, composition, light and shadow on the paper are all terrific. The shadows on the flat surface it''s resting on are a bit harsh. If you had softened the lighting to soften those shadows, I would have given it an extra point or two.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I''m not sure that it''s a great example of texture but the creative idea, composition, light and shadow on the paper are all terrific. The shadows on the flat surface it''s resting on are a bit harsh. If you had softened the lighting to soften those shadows, I would have given it an extra point or two.', '2005-07-25 02:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560409, 206449, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think this would be an excellent entry but it is so small I can''t see the detail I''d like to. Try to use all the pixels available to you ... 640 on a side.</td>', 'I think this would be an excellent entry but it is so small I can''t see the detail I''d like to. Try to use all the pixels available to you ... 640 on a side.', '2005-07-25 02:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560416, 205294, 36619, '<td valign="top">i don''t even care what this is. it''s beautiful.</td>', 'i don''t even care what this is. it''s beautiful.', '2005-07-25 02:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560427, 205199, 36619, '<td valign="top">very nice job!</td>', 'very nice job!', '2005-07-25 02:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
