(1560840, 206518, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I just voted on a similar shot but this one is so much better.  The main reason I like it more are the shapes in the stone/coral.  Maybe I am just insane but I make out a dog, a guy running and another one kicking his behind.  The lighting is very good and all in all I very much like this shot, though not enough to give it a 10 but it got a solid 9 from me.</td>', 'Awesome!  I just voted on a similar shot but this one is so much better.  The main reason I like it more are the shapes in the stone/coral.  Maybe I am just insane but I make out a dog, a guy running and another one kicking his behind.  The lighting is very good and all in all I very much like this shot, though not enough to give it a 10 but it got a solid 9 from me.', '2005-07-25 06:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
