(1560864, 203646, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of the few pictures that has a person in a shot that isn´t a close up of a beard or eyebrows or such and it makes it stand out, I like it and it breaks up the voting in the challenge, I immediately noticed this thumbnail.  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice, one of the few pictures that has a person in a shot that isn´t a close up of a beard or eyebrows or such and it makes it stand out, I like it and it breaks up the voting in the challenge, I immediately noticed this thumbnail.  Nice work.', '2005-07-25 07:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560881, 206036, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s pretty hard to rate this fairly for two reasons.<br/> <br/>1.  It badly out of focus or really cropped up close since this isn´t even close to being sharp.<br/> <br/>2.  Image noise is pretty bad, especially in the brown and blue areas, again could be from severe cropping but the result is the same.  Therefore the dynamic range is very narrow, a couple of portion of the shot has blown out highlights and the colours look dull and off putting.<br/> <br/>At least you stayed on topic and it looks like a decent shot if it were not for the 2 points I brought up.</td>', 'It´s pretty hard to rate this fairly for two reasons. 1.  It badly out of focus or really cropped up close since this isn´t even close to being sharp. 2.  Image noise is pretty bad, especially in the brown and blue areas, again could be from severe cropping but the result is the same.  Therefore the dynamic range is very narrow, a couple of portion of the shot has blown out highlights and the colours look dull and off putting. At least you stayed on topic and it looks like a decent shot if it were not for the 2 points I brought up.', '2005-07-25 07:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560888, 203686, 27482, '<td valign="top">The most original of all the melon shots I have seen so far, and I have seen to many...  Good lighting on the melon itself.  7 from me.</td>', 'The most original of all the melon shots I have seen so far, and I have seen to many...  Good lighting on the melon itself.  7 from me.', '2005-07-25 07:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560890, 205707, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, I love the two colours in this shot and how they affect each other and the soft focus ties it nicely together, excellent shot.</td>', 'Pretty cool, I love the two colours in this shot and how they affect each other and the soft focus ties it nicely together, excellent shot.', '2005-07-25 07:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560897, 203893, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice details, love the crips sharpness of this shot and the backround really compliments the blue feather, nice job!</td>', 'Nice details, love the crips sharpness of this shot and the backround really compliments the blue feather, nice job!', '2005-07-25 07:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560899, 203824, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this, odd how the texture in the clouds reminds me of water.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this, odd how the texture in the clouds reminds me of water.  Good job.', '2005-07-25 07:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560902, 205294, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is an open challenge with basic editing since there are so many dust spots in the upper right corner, I am not going to let that affect my vote as I am sure you would have removed them if you could have.  I like this shot, the composition is very good and excellent colours/contrast.  I do however feel that it is slightly oversharpened, there seems to be a sharpening halo around the person up in the left corner.  Great job all around, hope this comes out close to the top.<br/> <br/>Ááááfram ísland!</td>', 'Too bad this is an open challenge with basic editing since there are so many dust spots in the upper right corner, I am not going to let that affect my vote as I am sure you would have removed them if you could have.  I like this shot, the composition is very good and excellent colours/contrast.  I do however feel that it is slightly oversharpened, there seems to be a sharpening halo around the person up in the left corner.  Great job all around, hope this comes out close to the top. Ááááfram ísland!', '2005-07-25 07:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560917, 205759, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, hardlly the most original shot in the bunch but I like the outcome, especially the mysterious glow behind the leaf and the fact that it´s all green.  Nice work, one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting, hardlly the most original shot in the bunch but I like the outcome, especially the mysterious glow behind the leaf and the fact that it´s all green.  Nice work, one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-07-25 08:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1560930, 205550, 39553, '<td valign="top">Nice textures nicely brought out by the B&amp;W.  Texture isn''t the main theme here though, the portrait is...</td>', 'Nice textures nicely brought out by the B&W.  Texture isn''t the main theme here though, the portrait is...', '2005-07-25 08:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
