(1560986, 204836, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I''ll be damned.  I just finished complimenting one elephant''s ass, and here''s another one.  All these years without one, and now it''s two in five minutes.  Now that I''m fast becoming an expert on the subject, I can say that this elephant''s ass has slightly the better composition.  Bravo!  8</td>', 'Well I''ll be damned.  I just finished complimenting one elephant''s ass, and here''s another one.  All these years without one, and now it''s two in five minutes.  Now that I''m fast becoming an expert on the subject, I can say that this elephant''s ass has slightly the better composition.  Bravo!  8', '2005-07-25 09:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
