(1561387, 206261, 41247, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors here.  The red area on the right helps to offest the drops on the leaf and keeps my attention in the picture.  The light edge of the leaf also makes an interesting divider, further creating visual contrast between the two sides.</td>', 'I like the contrasting colors here.  The red area on the right helps to offest the drops on the leaf and keeps my attention in the picture.  The light edge of the leaf also makes an interesting divider, further creating visual contrast between the two sides.', '2005-07-25 11:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561400, 205904, 41247, '<td valign="top">I think I am seeing the picture upside down.  If this is an accident then the image correctly oriented is nice, but I would like to see a closer image of the puzzle lines.  If the image was intended to be oriented this way, then I think that the disorientation produced by the angle doesn''e fit the subject of the puzzle.  A darker, possibly sinister image on the puzzle would have worked well with the unusual angle.</td>', 'I think I am seeing the picture upside down.  If this is an accident then the image correctly oriented is nice, but I would like to see a closer image of the puzzle lines.  If the image was intended to be oriented this way, then I think that the disorientation produced by the angle doesn''e fit the subject of the puzzle.  A darker, possibly sinister image on the puzzle would have worked well with the unusual angle.', '2005-07-25 11:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1561405, 206495, 41247, '<td valign="top">I like the different colors in this image.  It provides some contrast, but I think to really bring out the texture of the rocks, more angular light is needed.</td>', 'I like the different colors in this image.  It provides some contrast, but I think to really bring out the texture of the rocks, more angular light is needed.', '2005-07-25 11:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
