(1562482, 203810, 34192, '<td valign="top">While the image is in focus, the lighting does not add any depth to the texture -  even smooth can show texture by throwing off light.  Would like to see this re-shot with sunlight coming in in the morning or late afternoon.  5</td>', 'While the image is in focus, the lighting does not add any depth to the texture -  even smooth can show texture by throwing off light.  Would like to see this re-shot with sunlight coming in in the morning or late afternoon.  5', '2005-07-25 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
