(1562512, 203847, 36078, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture.  I read in the forums alot of people were voting down left over zoo pictures.  I am just voting on he merits of each image.  I like the zebra background.  Nice comosition.  I hate to say this but I would have liked it with a simple black and white border.  I still gave it an 8.</td>', 'Very nice texture.  I read in the forums alot of people were voting down left over zoo pictures.  I am just voting on he merits of each image.  I like the zebra background.  Nice comosition.  I hate to say this but I would have liked it with a simple black and white border.  I still gave it an 8.', '2005-07-25 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
