(1562519, 206302, 36078, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle colors.  I know how difficult it is to get pictures of snakes.  I have a ball python.  Lovely expression with the coils.  I gave it an 8 but if you couldave gotten one with its tongue out I would have given it a 10.</td>', 'Nice subtle colors.  I know how difficult it is to get pictures of snakes.  I have a ball python.  Lovely expression with the coils.  I gave it an 8 but if you couldave gotten one with its tongue out I would have given it a 10.', '2005-07-25 19:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
