(1562550, 205294, 30364, '<td valign="top">Looks like Iceland; landscape by Wagner, plus a few UFO''s visible in the heavy sky.  Anyway, it''s terrific.  So much texture it almost looks three-dimensional!  I also like the figure exiting the shot; not just for the scale it gives, but it also suggests that this is an uncomfortable place.  I''m not sure what you''ve done with the colour; it doesn''t seem to be a simple selective desat ... whatever it is, I think it suits this subject.  8</td>', 'Looks like Iceland; landscape by Wagner, plus a few UFO''s visible in the heavy sky.  Anyway, it''s terrific.  So much texture it almost looks three-dimensional!  I also like the figure exiting the shot; not just for the scale it gives, but it also suggests that this is an uncomfortable place.  I''m not sure what you''ve done with the colour; it doesn''t seem to be a simple selective desat ... whatever it is, I think it suits this subject.  8', '2005-07-25 20:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562556, 206141, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very strong image.  Terrific textures and colours, but also well composed and exposed.  7</td>', 'Very strong image.  Terrific textures and colours, but also well composed and exposed.  7', '2005-07-25 20:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562558, 206152, 30364, '<td valign="top">Striking scene and well photographed to emphasise the soft, tactile nature of the lavender rows.  Like a macro of a bath mat!  7</td>', 'Striking scene and well photographed to emphasise the soft, tactile nature of the lavender rows.  Like a macro of a bath mat!  7', '2005-07-25 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562561, 206402, 11895, '<td valign="top">lovely shot but I wish it had more depth of field</td>', 'lovely shot but I wish it had more depth of field', '2005-07-25 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562563, 206070, 30364, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this lovely, spare image that I find very appealing.  The contrasting textures of the two subjects are very effectively shown.  The lighting is beautiful.  But I think it''s the composition and the bold crop that I like best.  8</td>', 'There''s something about this lovely, spare image that I find very appealing.  The contrasting textures of the two subjects are very effectively shown.  The lighting is beautiful.  But I think it''s the composition and the bold crop that I like best.  8', '2005-07-25 20:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562570, 206397, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed to show the several interesting textures.  I hate it when people say this, but I''d also love to see this as a contrasty B&amp;W.  ( I hate it because it''s like saying, "Thanks for the fried egg, but can you make it look more like bacon?").  Anyway, I do like your image just as it is as well.  7</td>', 'Nicely composed to show the several interesting textures.  I hate it when people say this, but I''d also love to see this as a contrasty B&W.  ( I hate it because it''s like saying, "Thanks for the fried egg, but can you make it look more like bacon?").  Anyway, I do like your image just as it is as well.  7', '2005-07-25 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562576, 206564, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very effective photograph of some nasty looking textures.  Good composition and depth of field.  7</td>', 'A very effective photograph of some nasty looking textures.  Good composition and depth of field.  7', '2005-07-25 20:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562582, 205235, 41131, '<td valign="top">Crisp, vivid  image.  Use of side lighting very effective.</td>', 'Crisp, vivid  image.  Use of side lighting very effective.', '2005-07-25 20:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562589, 205773, 41131, '<td valign="top">Classic use  of "rule of thirds" effectively directs eye to main image.</td>', 'Classic use  of "rule of thirds" effectively directs eye to main image.', '2005-07-25 20:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562591, 205298, 30364, '<td valign="top">This peeling paint has a strange, cave-painting quality, I guess because of the apparent human figure on the right.  Love the water spigot.  Overall, it''s an absorbing image with a very pleasing feel to it.  7</td>', 'This peeling paint has a strange, cave-painting quality, I guess because of the apparent human figure on the right.  Love the water spigot.  Overall, it''s an absorbing image with a very pleasing feel to it.  7', '2005-07-25 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562602, 206091, 41131, '<td valign="top">Good B/W tonal qualities give impression of planetary topography.</td>', 'Good B/W tonal qualities give impression of planetary topography.', '2005-07-25 20:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562605, 206353, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the most interesting photograph of lily pads I''ve seen.  I love the way you''ve captured the light on the softly curled edges of the pads.  Featuring the single flower balanced by the opposing patch of clear water was also very effective.  I applaud the overall composition, the crop (if any) and the chosen depth of field.  Overall, a lovely photograph.  Bravo!  8</td>', 'This is the most interesting photograph of lily pads I''ve seen.  I love the way you''ve captured the light on the softly curled edges of the pads.  Featuring the single flower balanced by the opposing patch of clear water was also very effective.  I applaud the overall composition, the crop (if any) and the chosen depth of field.  Overall, a lovely photograph.  Bravo!  8', '2005-07-25 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562617, 205730, 41131, '<td valign="top">Oh! This image pops! The color cast makes it seem like a non terrene landscape...</td>', 'Oh! This image pops! The color cast makes it seem like a non terrene landscape...', '2005-07-25 20:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562624, 206091, 36231, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to realize I was looking at a cantelope and a coconut! Very cool!   I love the lighting, and the textures really stand out. Great job! :)</td>', 'It took me a minute to realize I was looking at a cantelope and a coconut! Very cool!   I love the lighting, and the textures really stand out. Great job! :)', '2005-07-25 20:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562628, 206325, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the song and love your photograph.  This is a very interesting gate.  The textures in the wood and in the metal are sympathetically handled in your nicely lit and well-exposed image. 7</td>', 'Love the song and love your photograph.  This is a very interesting gate.  The textures in the wood and in the metal are sympathetically handled in your nicely lit and well-exposed image. 7', '2005-07-25 20:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562638, 206555, 41131, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal qualities. Looks like you made good use of zone system mechanics applied to digital values.</td>', 'Excellent tonal qualities. Looks like you made good use of zone system mechanics applied to digital values.', '2005-07-25 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562651, 203949, 41131, '<td valign="top">Good tonal B/W tonal quality. Subject detail sharp and crisp.</td>', 'Good tonal B/W tonal quality. Subject detail sharp and crisp.', '2005-07-25 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562655, 205016, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great image of a classic textured profile.  I very much like the composition and of course the lighting.  The exposure is very good, and the processing is terrific.  9</td>', 'Great image of a classic textured profile.  I very much like the composition and of course the lighting.  The exposure is very good, and the processing is terrific.  9', '2005-07-25 21:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562658, 206347, 41131, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and framing of image. Fingers suggest movement almost like they''re underwater.</td>', 'I like the colors and framing of image. Fingers suggest movement almost like they''re underwater.', '2005-07-25 21:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562668, 206338, 41131, '<td valign="top">Arresting macro image. Color is intense and nicely softened by the water drops.</td>', 'Arresting macro image. Color is intense and nicely softened by the water drops.', '2005-07-25 21:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562695, 204514, 41131, '<td valign="top">Love the red!! Petals do look like cloth.....</td>', 'Love the red!! Petals do look like cloth.....', '2005-07-25 21:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
