(1562721, 205736, 32754, '<td valign="top">best in contest as far as I''m concerned...the eye is what gets you when you look at this picture: the texture is somewhat unusual until you see the eye, then the whole picture is alive and elevated to art. nice subtle contrast in skin, lighting is perfect as is composition and crop...10</td>', 'best in contest as far as I''m concerned...the eye is what gets you when you look at this picture: the texture is somewhat unusual until you see the eye, then the whole picture is alive and elevated to art. nice subtle contrast in skin, lighting is perfect as is composition and crop...10', '2005-07-25 21:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562723, 205321, 41131, '<td valign="top">Nice macro! Effective lighting too.</td>', 'Nice macro! Effective lighting too.', '2005-07-25 21:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562726, 203449, 41131, '<td valign="top">Sweet!</td>', 'Sweet!', '2005-07-25 21:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562728, 205465, 32754, '<td valign="top">simple, yet visually arresting..lovely work</td>', 'simple, yet visually arresting..lovely work', '2005-07-25 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562733, 206304, 41131, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting!</td>', 'Love the lighting!', '2005-07-25 21:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562735, 206293, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and complexity of these vines: visually fascinating shot.</td>', 'I like the tones and complexity of these vines: visually fascinating shot.', '2005-07-25 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562736, 204143, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors -- good use of a polarizing filter, I''d imagine.  Very cool shot! - 10</td>', 'Beautiful colors -- good use of a polarizing filter, I''d imagine.  Very cool shot! - 10', '2005-07-25 21:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562740, 203650, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro!  Never would have thought of doing this, and if I had thought of it, I''m sure I wouldn''t have executed it as well as you have here. - 10</td>', 'Excellent macro!  Never would have thought of doing this, and if I had thought of it, I''m sure I wouldn''t have executed it as well as you have here. - 10', '2005-07-25 21:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562744, 204969, 41131, '<td valign="top">How can you not love this???????</td>', 'How can you not love this???????', '2005-07-25 21:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562748, 206215, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love the colors here!  The combination of colors is just super... almost makes me want to buy some paint and make a room in this combination!  Great job on getting the feather so well exposed without blowing any of it out! - 10</td>', 'I love the colors here!  The combination of colors is just super... almost makes me want to buy some paint and make a room in this combination!  Great job on getting the feather so well exposed without blowing any of it out! - 10', '2005-07-25 21:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562749, 204541, 3102, '<td valign="top">Out of 600+ entries, this is certainly among my favorites.  Great colors and nice details! - 10</td>', 'Out of 600+ entries, this is certainly among my favorites.  Great colors and nice details! - 10', '2005-07-25 21:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1562753, 204953, 3102, '<td valign="top">The colors are just beautiful here, and of course it''s very impressive to get just a great deal of detail in a macro like this.  A 10 from me all the way!</td>', 'The colors are just beautiful here, and of course it''s very impressive to get just a great deal of detail in a macro like this.  A 10 from me all the way!', '2005-07-25 21:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
