(1562760, 203686, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of thought went into this one, and it paid off!  I like the detail in the melon, and it was clever to make it into a space theme.  A 10!</td>', 'Looks like a lot of thought went into this one, and it paid off!  I like the detail in the melon, and it was clever to make it into a space theme.  A 10!', '2005-07-25 21:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
