(1563397, 206259, 37893, '<td valign="top">I was certain someone was going to provide a mushroom photo. it won a previous Textures challenge :) Anyway, as far as the photo is concerned the DOF bothers me a tad because there seems to be so much blur in the foreground. Maybe an improvement on DOF? Of the whole image, only about 35% is discernable and in focus. Great color and concept.</td>', 'I was certain someone was going to provide a mushroom photo. it won a previous Textures challenge :) Anyway, as far as the photo is concerned the DOF bothers me a tad because there seems to be so much blur in the foreground. Maybe an improvement on DOF? Of the whole image, only about 35% is discernable and in focus. Great color and concept.', '2005-07-26 03:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
