(1563602, 203824, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph and lovely new (for me) word; "noctilucent"  .. presumably it means shining or glowing at night.  The effect is of a water surface, viewed from below.  Beautiful, and a thoroughly legitimate texture study.  7</td>', 'Lovely photograph and lovely new (for me) word; "noctilucent"  .. presumably it means shining or glowing at night.  The effect is of a water surface, viewed from below.  Beautiful, and a thoroughly legitimate texture study.  7', '2005-07-26 07:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563603, 204978, 41163, '<td valign="top">Bring me this one sharp and I''ll make it favorite!</td>', 'Bring me this one sharp and I''ll make it favorite!', '2005-07-26 07:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563606, 206031, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple but very nice.  I like the lighting and the composition, which work together with the DOF to direct the attention to the most revealing part of the hand; the pads beneath the fingers.  7</td>', 'Simple but very nice.  I like the lighting and the composition, which work together with the DOF to direct the attention to the most revealing part of the hand; the pads beneath the fingers.  7', '2005-07-26 07:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563614, 204785, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing composition; balanced asymmetry!  The shadow of the log end is especially good.  And the image showcases the several textures effectively.  Also a finely judged exposure, given the tonal range you''ve managed to capture.  Plus it''s B&amp;W ... Bravo!  8</td>', 'This is a very appealing composition; balanced asymmetry!  The shadow of the log end is especially good.  And the image showcases the several textures effectively.  Also a finely judged exposure, given the tonal range you''ve managed to capture.  Plus it''s B&W ... Bravo!  8', '2005-07-26 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563619, 205346, 38508, '<td valign="top">great image.. color, light, texture.. but personaly, I would use another frame.</td>', 'great image.. color, light, texture.. but personaly, I would use another frame.', '2005-07-26 07:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563623, 206524, 30364, '<td valign="top">There''s several things I like about this.  It''s a very interesting composition.  You''ve captured the physical texture well, but you have also managed to suggest both the material (brass) and, somehow, the shimmering sound; another two dimensions of "texture"!  I think it''s a terrific image, and I hope its qualities are not underestimated in the voting.  8</td>', 'There''s several things I like about this.  It''s a very interesting composition.  You''ve captured the physical texture well, but you have also managed to suggest both the material (brass) and, somehow, the shimmering sound; another two dimensions of "texture"!  I think it''s a terrific image, and I hope its qualities are not underestimated in the voting.  8', '2005-07-26 07:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563627, 206333, 30364, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition, with palpable texture.  I suppose there will be comments both pro and con the centred eye.. put me down for pro in this case.  7</td>', 'An interesting composition, with palpable texture.  I suppose there will be comments both pro and con the centred eye.. put me down for pro in this case.  7', '2005-07-26 08:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563630, 204072, 30364, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the elephant shots; the trunk gives it life and depth.  And naturally, the texture of this subject is always appealing.   8</td>', 'My favourite of the elephant shots; the trunk gives it life and depth.  And naturally, the texture of this subject is always appealing.   8', '2005-07-26 08:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563633, 205199, 30364, '<td valign="top">An elegant composition with a well selected depth of field to emphasise the texture; soft but also fine.  Not the most interesting subject, but your handling of it is very effective.  7</td>', 'An elegant composition with a well selected depth of field to emphasise the texture; soft but also fine.  Not the most interesting subject, but your handling of it is very effective.  7', '2005-07-26 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563637, 206382, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very good; it does somehow convey effectively the muffled feel of heavy, cold, cut stone, and it does so not by showing us a close-up of the surface texture (which wouldn''t work), but rather by showing us the mood created by the light ... emotional texture.  It''s a photograph that rewards a minute''s close study.  At first the highlights seem overblown, but they''re not; just enough detail is there, as it is in the deep shadows on the floor.  A finely judged exposure.  9  <br/>Back for a last look; I''ve got to select one 10, and this is it.  10.</td>', 'This is very good; it does somehow convey effectively the muffled feel of heavy, cold, cut stone, and it does so not by showing us a close-up of the surface texture (which wouldn''t work), but rather by showing us the mood created by the light ... emotional texture.  It''s a photograph that rewards a minute''s close study.  At first the highlights seem overblown, but they''re not; just enough detail is there, as it is in the deep shadows on the floor.  A finely judged exposure.  9  Back for a last look; I''ve got to select one 10, and this is it.  10.', '2005-07-26 08:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563640, 205298, 34425, '<td valign="top">love the colors... i can feel the texture of the rust and the cracked paint... amazing!</td>', 'love the colors... i can feel the texture of the rust and the cracked paint... amazing!', '2005-07-26 08:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563657, 206282, 34425, '<td valign="top">great texture... the lighting highlighted the veins in the rose'' petals. i love the feel of this velvetty smooth rose. great shot!</td>', 'great texture... the lighting highlighted the veins in the rose'' petals. i love the feel of this velvetty smooth rose. great shot!', '2005-07-26 08:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
