(1563698, 205016, 34425, '<td valign="top">this is what i''ve been looking for... character lines and facial texture which will show well in b/w... suggest reduce the empty space which is kinda distracting. don''t get me wrong, i like empty negative spaces but i think this time it sort of drew my attention away from the subject.</td>', 'this is what i''ve been looking for... character lines and facial texture which will show well in b/w... suggest reduce the empty space which is kinda distracting. don''t get me wrong, i like empty negative spaces but i think this time it sort of drew my attention away from the subject.', '2005-07-26 08:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563708, 204003, 34425, '<td valign="top">good b/w tones... good texture except for the washed-out part of the ball. nice concept which can be a good advertising photo.</td>', 'good b/w tones... good texture except for the washed-out part of the ball. nice concept which can be a good advertising photo.', '2005-07-26 08:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
