(1563725, 204607, 4153, '<td valign="top">this is getting a bit close to a picture of artwork isn''t it? I like it though, but somehow I think I would''ve preferred a desaturated image instead of grayscale - 7</td>', 'this is getting a bit close to a picture of artwork isn''t it? I like it though, but somehow I think I would''ve preferred a desaturated image instead of grayscale - 7', '2005-07-26 09:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
