(1563985, 204575, 37320, '<td valign="top">No way!  Not after last time, my leg is still healing, I will however, score you high for being the subject of a greta photo.</td>', 'No way!  Not after last time, my leg is still healing, I will however, score you high for being the subject of a greta photo.', '2005-07-26 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563986, 204226, 20023, '<td valign="top">Impressive Macro!</td>', 'Impressive Macro!', '2005-07-26 12:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563988, 205040, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: good placement of the vertical and horizontal lines though the leaf is a little close to the left and top edges.  Also, the leaf seems to take up too much space in the image.  A wider field of view I think would improve the image. 7<br/> <br/>Exposure: Seems ok though I feel a touch more luminance is needed since the lighting feels a bit flat. 6<br/> <br/>Impact: This is where the image works well due to the texture of the chosen subject.  More light/luminance would only make it better. 8<br/> <br/>Overall: 7</td>', 'Composition: good placement of the vertical and horizontal lines though the leaf is a little close to the left and top edges.  Also, the leaf seems to take up too much space in the image.  A wider field of view I think would improve the image. 7 Exposure: Seems ok though I feel a touch more luminance is needed since the lighting feels a bit flat. 6 Impact: This is where the image works well due to the texture of the chosen subject.  More light/luminance would only make it better. 8 Overall: 7', '2005-07-26 12:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563996, 206287, 4477, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting and good composition!</td>', 'Good use of lighting and good composition!', '2005-07-26 12:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563997, 203646, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: Great angle though I feel a wider field of view is needed to add depth. One distraction - the person''s shirt since the tones are brighter than other areas of the image.  7<br/> <br/>Exposure: Seems bang on.  Plenty of contrast and the texture of the bricks has been captured well. 10<br/> <br/>Impact: The angle of the shot is what creates the impact here and does the job quite well though I feel a wider field of view would add to the impact. 7<br/> <br/>Overall: 8</td>', 'Composition: Great angle though I feel a wider field of view is needed to add depth. One distraction - the person''s shirt since the tones are brighter than other areas of the image.  7 Exposure: Seems bang on.  Plenty of contrast and the texture of the bricks has been captured well. 10 Impact: The angle of the shot is what creates the impact here and does the job quite well though I feel a wider field of view would add to the impact. 7 Overall: 8', '2005-07-26 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563998, 203592, 20023, '<td valign="top">personally I think your depth of field is too narrow.  Also, why is the focal point on the grout and not the bricks?</td>', 'personally I think your depth of field is too narrow.  Also, why is the focal point on the grout and not the bricks?', '2005-07-26 12:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1563999, 205928, 20023, '<td valign="top">i would have never guessed that was an acorn with out the title.  Crazy macro!  good work.</td>', 'i would have never guessed that was an acorn with out the title.  Crazy macro!  good work.', '2005-07-26 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564000, 205144, 20023, '<td valign="top">i really like the texture of the bark, but something a little closer without the background would have highlighted the actual texture more</td>', 'i really like the texture of the bark, but something a little closer without the background would have highlighted the actual texture more', '2005-07-26 12:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564004, 205723, 20023, '<td valign="top">extremely narrow depth of field limits what we can see of the subject</td>', 'extremely narrow depth of field limits what we can see of the subject', '2005-07-26 12:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564007, 206303, 20023, '<td valign="top">why the random green stem?  I think it detracts from the stones'' texture.  It certainly pulls the eye away.</td>', 'why the random green stem?  I think it detracts from the stones'' texture.  It certainly pulls the eye away.', '2005-07-26 12:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564013, 203816, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: The mixture of light and dark work well due to the placement of the individual pieces of bark however the brightest piece is a little too central.  It may have worked better if that piece were on more of an angle. Also, the DOF seems a bit too shallow as some parts of the bark are out of focus.  This may only be a distraction due to its position in the composition.  6<br/> <br/>Exposure: Ok though the lighting is very harsh making it difficult to get a balance between the highlights and shadows. 5<br/> <br/>Impact: Impact is lost due to the harsh lighting.  More subtle lighting that enhances the detail I think would have worked better. 5<br/> <br/>Overall: 5</td>', 'Composition: The mixture of light and dark work well due to the placement of the individual pieces of bark however the brightest piece is a little too central.  It may have worked better if that piece were on more of an angle. Also, the DOF seems a bit too shallow as some parts of the bark are out of focus.  This may only be a distraction due to its position in the composition.  6 Exposure: Ok though the lighting is very harsh making it difficult to get a balance between the highlights and shadows. 5 Impact: Impact is lost due to the harsh lighting.  More subtle lighting that enhances the detail I think would have worked better. 5 Overall: 5', '2005-07-26 12:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564016, 205699, 39558, '<td valign="top">Great feel to this photo....Awesome texture...good job!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-28 17:56:59.</i></td>', 'Great feel to this photo....Awesome texture...good job!!!', '2005-07-26 12:25:42.000000', '2005-07-28 18:56:59.000000', 1),
(1564019, 205271, 20023, '<td valign="top">i like it, though a top down perspective may have made a better impression.  Good work!</td>', 'i like it, though a top down perspective may have made a better impression.  Good work!', '2005-07-26 12:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564020, 206131, 39558, '<td valign="top">touched my heart. Great photo....... reminding me to pray always for our children</td>', 'touched my heart. Great photo....... reminding me to pray always for our children', '2005-07-26 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564021, 206348, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: Seems to work with the placement of the main subject however the bright negative space is distracting.  The eye almost always will gravitate to the brightest area of an image.  Also, cropping slightly on the left may balance the image better. 6<br/> <br/>Exposure: Despite the bright negative space I feel that the image is underexposed.  More light on the main subject I believe would help as this would bring out the texture more. 5<br/> <br/>Impact: Unfortunately, due to the bright negative space and lack of light on the main subject a lot of the potential impact of this shot is lost. 5<br/> <br/>Overall: 5</td>', 'Composition: Seems to work with the placement of the main subject however the bright negative space is distracting.  The eye almost always will gravitate to the brightest area of an image.  Also, cropping slightly on the left may balance the image better. 6 Exposure: Despite the bright negative space I feel that the image is underexposed.  More light on the main subject I believe would help as this would bring out the texture more. 5 Impact: Unfortunately, due to the bright negative space and lack of light on the main subject a lot of the potential impact of this shot is lost. 5 Overall: 5', '2005-07-26 12:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
