(1564162, 204940, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>Detail in the flower seems hidden by the lighitng, maybe some curves adjustment can help this, the textures are still very much there, nice colors.  Maybe an off center placement would help give it more appeal.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  Detail in the flower seems hidden by the lighitng, maybe some curves adjustment can help this, the textures are still very much there, nice colors.  Maybe an off center placement would help give it more appeal. Good luck', '2005-07-26 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
