(1564167, 203940, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5<br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>Good placement, nice colors, focus seems a bit soft and hard to see the details in the petals but you still get the texture across.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits challenge=5Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  Good placement, nice colors, focus seems a bit soft and hard to see the details in the petals but you still get the texture across. Good luck', '2005-07-26 13:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564171, 204507, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice lead in with the tree on the left however the lower 1/3 of the photo seems rather cluttered due to lack of contrast.   Also, the crop at the top is a bit tight.  5<br/> <br/>Exposure: The intent may have been to generate a gloomy mood however the image feels a little under exposed and lacks contrast.  No true white or black. 5<br/> <br/>Impact: Some impact is generated by the choice of subject though more could be achieved if there was more overall contrast. 5<br/> <br/>Overall: 5</td>', 'Composition: Nice lead in with the tree on the left however the lower 1/3 of the photo seems rather cluttered due to lack of contrast.   Also, the crop at the top is a bit tight.  5 Exposure: The intent may have been to generate a gloomy mood however the image feels a little under exposed and lacks contrast.  No true white or black. 5 Impact: Some impact is generated by the choice of subject though more could be achieved if there was more overall contrast. 5 Overall: 5', '2005-07-26 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564177, 206468, 15542, '<td valign="top">I like black &amp; white. This is a very simple statement about textures and remind me the passion of Christ!</td>', 'I like black & white. This is a very simple statement about textures and remind me the passion of Christ!', '2005-07-26 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564180, 206498, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: Overall good placement though maybe a little too close or the crop slightly too tight on the left. 6<br/> <br/>Exposure: Though the colours look true to life and the texture is quite visible in the peeling paint I feel the lighting is a bit flat.  More lighting across the subject would help emphasize the texture but also give life to the subject. 5<br/> <br/>Impact: Neutral. In addition to the lack of light I feel the impact is lost with the shallow DOF.  The bottom 1/3 of the image is out of focus and I feel this takes away from the image.  5<br/> <br/>Overall: 5</td>', 'Composition: Overall good placement though maybe a little too close or the crop slightly too tight on the left. 6 Exposure: Though the colours look true to life and the texture is quite visible in the peeling paint I feel the lighting is a bit flat.  More lighting across the subject would help emphasize the texture but also give life to the subject. 5 Impact: Neutral. In addition to the lack of light I feel the impact is lost with the shallow DOF.  The bottom 1/3 of the image is out of focus and I feel this takes away from the image.  5 Overall: 5', '2005-07-26 13:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564183, 203800, 15542, '<td valign="top">The pattern and colors, especially the off line makes a good photo!</td>', 'The pattern and colors, especially the off line makes a good photo!', '2005-07-26 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
