(1564474, 206463, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have to give this one a 6 for sheer gusto and shock value. I take it you crusted cornflakes no your face and did a self-portrait? Or I suppose it may be a model... Technically I don''t find this especially well done, but what the heck... 6</td>', 'I have to give this one a 6 for sheer gusto and shock value. I take it you crusted cornflakes no your face and did a self-portrait? Or I suppose it may be a model... Technically I don''t find this especially well done, but what the heck... 6', '2005-07-26 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564481, 204978, 30861, '<td valign="top">The title is rather annoying in that this is a smile scallop-type bivalve shell and in NO way does it represent mother of pearl, but that''s really neither here nor there. It''s a pleasant image, made somewhat awkward by its slightly-too-tight cropping on the right.</td>', 'The title is rather annoying in that this is a smile scallop-type bivalve shell and in NO way does it represent mother of pearl, but that''s really neither here nor there. It''s a pleasant image, made somewhat awkward by its slightly-too-tight cropping on the right.', '2005-07-26 16:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564483, 205062, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought the image was extremely soothing and beautiful.  The only issie is that the background is way overexposed.  Even if you just hung some crepe paper behind the grape vine, you would have still got a softer light and it would have brought out the grapes more.</td>', 'Thought the image was extremely soothing and beautiful.  The only issie is that the background is way overexposed.  Even if you just hung some crepe paper behind the grape vine, you would have still got a softer light and it would have brought out the grapes more.', '2005-07-26 16:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564490, 206397, 30861, '<td valign="top">serious oversharpening is damaginf what could be an excellent, subtle shot. The oversaturation, espeically in the blue range, doesn''t help either. It is, however, very well seen.</td>', 'serious oversharpening is damaginf what could be an excellent, subtle shot. The oversaturation, espeically in the blue range, doesn''t help either. It is, however, very well seen.', '2005-07-26 17:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564494, 206555, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is seriously good! Texture is a dominant element but the image has meaning utterly apart from that. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Oh, this is seriously good! Texture is a dominant element but the image has meaning utterly apart from that. Very nicely done!', '2005-07-26 17:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564502, 205865, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image of which you can be very proud, but it falls well short of truly adressing the challenge IMO.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image of which you can be very proud, but it falls well short of truly adressing the challenge IMO.', '2005-07-26 17:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564511, 205723, 7743, '<td valign="top">Composition: Though I like the idea I feel that the image is out of balance.  This could be corrected with a small increase in DOF so the top of the image isn''t quite so out of focus or by cropping some off the top. 7<br/> <br/>Exposure: To me it''s almost right.  The sliver in the right third of the image has blown highlights.  Since it is in the area of sharp focus the blown highlights are a distraction.  However the texture in the rest of the area of strong focus has been brought out very well. 6<br/> <br/>Impact:  The texture of the wood is what creates the impact for this image though I think it could be improved if more of it were in focus. 6<br/> <br/>Overall: 6</td>', 'Composition: Though I like the idea I feel that the image is out of balance.  This could be corrected with a small increase in DOF so the top of the image isn''t quite so out of focus or by cropping some off the top. 7 Exposure: To me it''s almost right.  The sliver in the right third of the image has blown highlights.  Since it is in the area of sharp focus the blown highlights are a distraction.  However the texture in the rest of the area of strong focus has been brought out very well. 6 Impact:  The texture of the wood is what creates the impact for this image though I think it could be improved if more of it were in focus. 6 Overall: 6', '2005-07-26 17:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564513, 203939, 30861, '<td valign="top">A tour-de-force as far as I''m concerned; beautiful PP and stands above the other leaf entries in its much more dynamic, original composition. The texture, of course, is palpable.</td>', 'A tour-de-force as far as I''m concerned; beautiful PP and stands above the other leaf entries in its much more dynamic, original composition. The texture, of course, is palpable.', '2005-07-26 17:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564516, 206181, 30861, '<td valign="top">Yes, smooth is a texture. Very luminous and well-done.</td>', 'Yes, smooth is a texture. Very luminous and well-done.', '2005-07-26 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564519, 204507, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love this soft, understated image.</td>', 'I love this soft, understated image.', '2005-07-26 17:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564522, 206535, 30861, '<td valign="top">fantastic, cold texture, eerily luminous yet understated.</td>', 'fantastic, cold texture, eerily luminous yet understated.', '2005-07-26 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
