(1564769, 205272, 35161, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast and the shadows in this shot! Nice work! :)</td>', 'Love the contrast and the shadows in this shot! Nice work! :)', '2005-07-26 19:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564771, 205887, 35161, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and interesting textures! :)</td>', 'Nice angle and interesting textures! :)', '2005-07-26 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564774, 204541, 35161, '<td valign="top">Nice work! Love the orange tone! :)</td>', 'Nice work! Love the orange tone! :)', '2005-07-26 19:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564839, 204443, 30817, '<td valign="top">Not a good looking animal, but a great looking photograph!  The textures took the light perfectly and can almost be felt in this image.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'Not a good looking animal, but a great looking photograph!  The textures took the light perfectly and can almost be felt in this image.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564842, 204738, 30817, '<td valign="top">The wood/metal combination works so well to set one another off.  You certainly made me feel this door!  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'The wood/metal combination works so well to set one another off.  You certainly made me feel this door!  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 19:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564843, 204938, 30817, '<td valign="top">Triple textures, all clearly defined and recorded.  Fine work!  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'Triple textures, all clearly defined and recorded.  Fine work!  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 19:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564846, 206297, 30817, '<td valign="top">The idea of your viewer "feeling" texture through a photograph is not an easy assigment to meet, but you succeeded exceptionally well.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'The idea of your viewer "feeling" texture through a photograph is not an easy assigment to meet, but you succeeded exceptionally well.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 19:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564849, 206074, 30817, '<td valign="top">Just enough artisitic composition and quirky attitude to make this one of my ribbon favorites for this challenge.  Bad news is; I am rarely right about those things.  But .... this SHOULD be.  Just terrific work!</td>', 'Just enough artisitic composition and quirky attitude to make this one of my ribbon favorites for this challenge.  Bad news is; I am rarely right about those things.  But .... this SHOULD be.  Just terrific work!', '2005-07-26 19:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564851, 204774, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very different, interesting "out of the box" take on Texture. I like the way the Hollyhock plants stand out against the background &amp; the contrast of the soft, silky look of the flowers next to the rough look of the leaves.</td>', 'Very different, interesting "out of the box" take on Texture. I like the way the Hollyhock plants stand out against the background & the contrast of the soft, silky look of the flowers next to the rough look of the leaves.', '2005-07-26 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564857, 205199, 30817, '<td valign="top">One of a small percentage of 600 entries that I can actuallt FEEL the texture in the shot, I find this to be an exceptional piece on a few levels.  It is composed perfectly, has various interest points by using focus/nonfocus to advantage and most importantly, it emotes a feeling.... one of solitude and stillness. One can also read into this a hand helping another.  Nice work.  One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'One of a small percentage of 600 entries that I can actuallt FEEL the texture in the shot, I find this to be an exceptional piece on a few levels.  It is composed perfectly, has various interest points by using focus/nonfocus to advantage and most importantly, it emotes a feeling.... one of solitude and stillness. One can also read into this a hand helping another.  Nice work.  One of my ribbon picks.', '2005-07-26 20:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564860, 204785, 30817, '<td valign="top">Because of the bold use of light and shadow, I was very impressed with this piece.  Wonderful texturing on that roof.  No mistake as to what it feels like. One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'Because of the bold use of light and shadow, I was very impressed with this piece.  Wonderful texturing on that roof.  No mistake as to what it feels like. One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 20:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564862, 205704, 30817, '<td valign="top">I love good abstracted macros, and this is a VERY good one!  The texture reaches out to me, I don''t have to even try to imagine what this feels like.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'I love good abstracted macros, and this is a VERY good one!  The texture reaches out to me, I don''t have to even try to imagine what this feels like.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564870, 206534, 30817, '<td valign="top">Terrific subject for texture and a great compositional interpretation in order to define that texture precisely.  The leg behind the head giving some textural contrasts is so effective here.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.</td>', 'Terrific subject for texture and a great compositional interpretation in order to define that texture precisely.  The leg behind the head giving some textural contrasts is so effective here.  One of my top 10 favorites of this week.', '2005-07-26 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564877, 205365, 30817, '<td valign="top">There were many shots defining textures this week.  But there was only one that defined me ... this one.  I am so intrigued by this piece that so clearly goes beyond a theme challenge and floats into abstracted art as unobtrusively as a quiet whisper of wind through the fertile folds of a living being.  My personal blue for the week and added to my favorites.</td>', 'There were many shots defining textures this week.  But there was only one that defined me ... this one.  I am so intrigued by this piece that so clearly goes beyond a theme challenge and floats into abstracted art as unobtrusively as a quiet whisper of wind through the fertile folds of a living being.  My personal blue for the week and added to my favorites.', '2005-07-26 20:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564883, 205890, 36078, '<td valign="top">I like the coloration.  Nice composition.  Nice detail in the hair of the kiwi.  Nice idea executed very well.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I like the coloration.  Nice composition.  Nice detail in the hair of the kiwi.  Nice idea executed very well.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-07-26 20:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564885, 205290, 8860, '<td valign="top">Plenty of texture - and an unusual photo with a good range of detail. I''d have cropped out the background though to make it more potent.</td>', 'Plenty of texture - and an unusual photo with a good range of detail. I''d have cropped out the background though to make it more potent.', '2005-07-26 20:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1564886, 203692, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute, fuzzy little fella - lovely tones and great framing.</td>', 'Cute, fuzzy little fella - lovely tones and great framing.', '2005-07-26 20:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
