(1564894, 204082, 36078, '<td valign="top">Nice peice of driftwood.  Looks like a packing peanute to me though.  I do not mind the highlights on the front left.  I like the way the background fades right into it.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nice peice of driftwood.  Looks like a packing peanute to me though.  I do not mind the highlights on the front left.  I like the way the background fades right into it.  I gave it a 7.', '2005-07-26 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
