(1565601, 206139, 19936, '<td valign="top">Well, you did recognize this boat as I have used it before although it is not the ribbon winner that was done in infrared.  That was "shipwreck" by marbo, great shot.  I will retire this subject for awhile even though it is very tempting, I love the location.  Thanks to all who voted and commented.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-27 00:41:24.</i></td>', 'Well, you did recognize this boat as I have used it before although it is not the ribbon winner that was done in infrared.  That was "shipwreck" by marbo, great shot.  I will retire this subject for awhile even though it is very tempting, I love the location.  Thanks to all who voted and commented.', '2005-07-27 01:40:50.000000', '2005-07-27 01:41:24.000000', 0),
