(1565799, 205897, 40718, '<td valign="top">Wow. I am tickled with such a high finish.  I consider the competition to be quite stiff here and am honored with even a top 100 finish.  In the end, this picture isn''t that great.  It fulfills the challenge quite well, I believe, but it doesn''t fulfill the question "would you hang it on a wall?" very well.  I''m looking foward to more challenges in the future.</td>', 'Wow. I am tickled with such a high finish.  I consider the competition to be quite stiff here and am honored with even a top 100 finish.  In the end, this picture isn''t that great.  It fulfills the challenge quite well, I believe, but it doesn''t fulfill the question "would you hang it on a wall?" very well.  I''m looking foward to more challenges in the future.', '2005-07-27 02:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
