(1566360, 205294, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic atmosphere, this photo really is quite special.<br/>I could be wrong, but the texture looks like in-camera sharpening was on 0 or above... as a result the fine detail has become a little too sharp and pixelated. I prefer -2 in-camera sharpening with USM later and a little Blur to avoid that coarse bitty pixelated texture. Personally, I believe it would then have broken 8+.</td>', 'Fantastic atmosphere, this photo really is quite special.I could be wrong, but the texture looks like in-camera sharpening was on 0 or above... as a result the fine detail has become a little too sharp and pixelated. I prefer -2 in-camera sharpening with USM later and a little Blur to avoid that coarse bitty pixelated texture. Personally, I believe it would then have broken 8+.', '2005-07-27 08:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
