(1566411, 205068, 34192, '<td valign="top">Robert,  For what its worth, my opinion...  The technicals in this image are good.  What I think this image lacks is a point of focus.  Not camera focus, but more of a ''where do my eyes go'' focus.  Since this is more of an abstract image, my eyes tend to go to the lights and darks.  The lightest lights and the darkest darks have no texture.  So I look at the edges, the changes in tonality.  The edges fall across the image randomly with no order or pattern for me to follow.  The strongest lines swoop me down to the bottom right - into a jumbled mass.  This makes the entire image seem to be draining out of the bottom right.  The strong black at the top left reinforces that.  Hope what I stated makes some sense...</td>', 'Robert,  For what its worth, my opinion...  The technicals in this image are good.  What I think this image lacks is a point of focus.  Not camera focus, but more of a ''where do my eyes go'' focus.  Since this is more of an abstract image, my eyes tend to go to the lights and darks.  The lightest lights and the darkest darks have no texture.  So I look at the edges, the changes in tonality.  The edges fall across the image randomly with no order or pattern for me to follow.  The strongest lines swoop me down to the bottom right - into a jumbled mass.  This makes the entire image seem to be draining out of the bottom right.  The strong black at the top left reinforces that.  Hope what I stated makes some sense...', '2005-07-27 09:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1566426, 205294, 17203, '<td valign="top">OK, congrats on <i>another</i> ribbon, but this is getting ridiculous! A top 10 or ribbon in 6 consecutive challenges...sheesh! Whatever level comes after "Ribbon Hog," you''ve reached it. Most members don''t have a personal best as high as your average! Hope you enjoy another week of total domination. ;-)</td>', 'OK, congrats on another ribbon, but this is getting ridiculous! A top 10 or ribbon in 6 consecutive challenges...sheesh! Whatever level comes after "Ribbon Hog," you''ve reached it. Most members don''t have a personal best as high as your average! Hope you enjoy another week of total domination. ;-)', '2005-07-27 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 0),
