(1566571, 206468, 27763, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a strong top ten placing!  Beautiful photo. Looks great in black and white.  The disordered tangle of barbed wire adds to the textural feel of the image. The blurred background really makes the texture pop out, and I think that the white frame is an excellent idea to really make the greytones stand out from the grey DPChallenge background.  I''ll need to try this...  Great title, too.</td>', 'Congratulations on a strong top ten placing!  Beautiful photo. Looks great in black and white.  The disordered tangle of barbed wire adds to the textural feel of the image. The blurred background really makes the texture pop out, and I think that the white frame is an excellent idea to really make the greytones stand out from the grey DPChallenge background.  I''ll need to try this...  Great title, too.', '2005-07-27 10:10:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1566592, 206390, 30881, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors Mother Nature gave this little critter, and you captured them beautifully. Very nice shot. I would have preferred a live one.<br/>Have you tried putting live ones in a freezer for about 10 minutes(varies on temp.) They come out very groggy and sit well for portraits.</td>', 'Amazing colors Mother Nature gave this little critter, and you captured them beautifully. Very nice shot. I would have preferred a live one.Have you tried putting live ones in a freezer for about 10 minutes(varies on temp.) They come out very groggy and sit well for portraits.', '2005-07-27 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
