(1566739, 203692, 38032, '<td valign="top">I wanna know who gave this shot a score of  "1" of 10  ... that is hillarious!  This is a great image but I can''t believe you cheated :) ... Regrettably, I didn''t have time to score all the images and I missed this one.  I definitely would have given it at least a 2!!! Oh my ---! Seriously: 9<br/> <br/>A quick story: I was golfing once and a guy in my foursome saw a squirrel and started chasing it swinging his golf club and yelling "tree rat!" .. By the time this man was half in the woods, the squirrel had outwitted him and was standing back on the tee-box.  He seriously had a problem with squirrels for some reason (I am an all-animal loving almost-vegetarian for the record) ... but it was funny to see that weirdo get out-smarted by a squirrel!   Anyway - thanks for the great image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-27 13:20:11.</i></td>', 'I wanna know who gave this shot a score of  "1" of 10  ... that is hillarious!  This is a great image but I can''t believe you cheated :) ... Regrettably, I didn''t have time to score all the images and I missed this one.  I definitely would have given it at least a 2!!! Oh my ---! Seriously: 9 A quick story: I was golfing once and a guy in my foursome saw a squirrel and started chasing it swinging his golf club and yelling "tree rat!" .. By the time this man was half in the woods, the squirrel had outwitted him and was standing back on the tee-box.  He seriously had a problem with squirrels for some reason (I am an all-animal loving almost-vegetarian for the record) ... but it was funny to see that weirdo get out-smarted by a squirrel!   Anyway - thanks for the great image.', '2005-07-27 11:38:52.000000', '2005-07-27 14:20:11.000000', 0),
