(1570425, 204627, 35513, '<td valign="top">You know....you''re gonna have to tell me how you get this to come out so good.  I''ve tried several times for this kind of shot and can''t get it.  Great colors and lighting.  I think having the leaf backlit is the key.  Good composition with getting close enough to the leaf that we can see detail and yet far enough away that we are looking at a larger section of the leaf.</td>', 'You know....you''re gonna have to tell me how you get this to come out so good.  I''ve tried several times for this kind of shot and can''t get it.  Great colors and lighting.  I think having the leaf backlit is the key.  Good composition with getting close enough to the leaf that we can see detail and yet far enough away that we are looking at a larger section of the leaf.', '2005-07-28 18:26:17.000000', NULL, 0),
