(1628477, 203754, 38149, '<td valign="top">This picture is great.  My comments mirror most of what has been said, the colours etc and the feather is just great - thats what makes this picture more than just a frog in a pond.  I may have tried to get more of leaves behind her in focus but that may not be possible?</td>', 'This picture is great.  My comments mirror most of what has been said, the colours etc and the feather is just great - thats what makes this picture more than just a frog in a pond.  I may have tried to get more of leaves behind her in focus but that may not be possible?', '2005-08-21 17:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
