(1648554, 206468, 37719, '<td valign="top">I failed to comment on this during the challenge.  Probably because I am somewhat turned off by images that represent either through the image itself or the title a religious theme.  But this, even with the title, is an excellent image.  Very well composed and b/w was a perfect choice.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I failed to comment on this during the challenge.  Probably because I am somewhat turned off by images that represent either through the image itself or the title a religious theme.  But this, even with the title, is an excellent image.  Very well composed and b/w was a perfect choice.  Very nicely done!', '2005-08-26 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
