(1684219, 203696, 17507, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite picture from your portfolio, lovely textures and colors. It should not have scored so low! I might suggest trying a borderless version, or maybe a lighter color and thinner border. The detail of the incoming wave crests is very appealing, and produces a good sense of depth in this image, complementary to the leading lines of the coast.</td>', 'This is probably my favorite picture from your portfolio, lovely textures and colors. It should not have scored so low! I might suggest trying a borderless version, or maybe a lighter color and thinner border. The detail of the incoming wave crests is very appealing, and produces a good sense of depth in this image, complementary to the leading lines of the coast.', '2005-09-07 20:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
