(1694125, 206297, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wow. Didn''t realize how many of your images I liked until I came to comment. I gave this one a 7. I love the simplicity, the colors and the composition.</td>', 'Wow. Didn''t realize how many of your images I liked until I came to comment. I gave this one a 7. I love the simplicity, the colors and the composition.', '2005-09-11 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
