(1694867, 203538, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is such a great shot it should have done better.  I can feel the texture of the glass just as if I was holding it in my hand.  The color choices are good, focus is great and the angle of the shot makes it complete.  Very nice job!</td>', 'This is such a great shot it should have done better.  I can feel the texture of the glass just as if I was holding it in my hand.  The color choices are good, focus is great and the angle of the shot makes it complete.  Very nice job!', '2005-09-11 11:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
