(1760217, 204967, 40454, '<td valign="top">A phantastic good foto - the glowing at the head in front of - the texture in the backgraound - the balance of sharp and unsharp (back/front) - an the format is the ideal for the composing - ... - may al little bit more dark (black/ contrast), this is subjectiv ...</td>', 'A phantastic good foto - the glowing at the head in front of - the texture in the backgraound - the balance of sharp and unsharp (back/front) - an the format is the ideal for the composing - ... - may al little bit more dark (black/ contrast), this is subjectiv ...', '2005-10-05 04:27:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1760238, 205294, 40454, '<td valign="top">wow - you are a great photgrapher. Do you doesn''t use digital post production effects/ corection options? It''s no problem to remove little unlike elements with Photoshop CS. So if you doesn''t use them, do you realy finde a so good color/uncolor contrast in real? Yes - cool - you have a great talent to find the right location at the right moment and the sun (light) ist with you *g*</td>', 'wow - you are a great photgrapher. Do you doesn''t use digital post production effects/ corection options? It''s no problem to remove little unlike elements with Photoshop CS. So if you doesn''t use them, do you realy finde a so good color/uncolor contrast in real? Yes - cool - you have a great talent to find the right location at the right moment and the sun (light) ist with you *g*', '2005-10-05 04:39:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1768164, 203369, 34247, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a brave decision to go with this image, and I respect that. I think the focus choice is right given what the theme of the challenge was, but I do feel this image would be stronger with sharper focus on the foot itself. Maybe highlight the texturing on the toes and the sole, etc.</td>', 'I think it''s a brave decision to go with this image, and I respect that. I think the focus choice is right given what the theme of the challenge was, but I do feel this image would be stronger with sharper focus on the foot itself. Maybe highlight the texturing on the toes and the sole, etc.', '2005-10-07 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1771952, 205017, 37893, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 during the challenge. The textures of this rusted piece is quite extra-ordinary. As mentioned in the prior comments, the white area in the bakground is blown and distracts from the viewer''s eye. It would probably be better if the crop was tighter in this shot.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 during the challenge. The textures of this rusted piece is quite extra-ordinary. As mentioned in the prior comments, the white area in the bakground is blown and distracts from the viewer''s eye. It would probably be better if the crop was tighter in this shot.', '2005-10-09 15:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
