(1835770, 204733, 42392, '<td valign="top">i can''t see where this picture is out of focus but that is just my opinion-i love the way the model has that diva styleHA!HA!</td>', 'i can''t see where this picture is out of focus but that is just my opinion-i love the way the model has that diva styleHA!HA!', '2005-11-03 11:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1850621, 205897, 40386, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot when I voted was one of my favorites in the challenge.  Knowing how you lit it now I cant help but wonder how it would have looked if you had lit it with a strobe flash on black velvet to get a sharper image?  Great shot, I dont like grapefruit but I find myself wanting to reach out and eat it!</td>', 'I liked this shot when I voted was one of my favorites in the challenge.  Knowing how you lit it now I cant help but wonder how it would have looked if you had lit it with a strobe flash on black velvet to get a sharper image?  Great shot, I dont like grapefruit but I find myself wanting to reach out and eat it!', '2005-11-09 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
