(1947978, 204162, 42100, '<td valign="top">Man,I wish I was around for the voting of this challenge.  I love this photo,  I''d of voted it a "10."  Meets the challenge and is technically excellent.  I also find this photo humurous, brings a smile to my face everytime I look at it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Man,I wish I was around for the voting of this challenge.  I love this photo,  I''d of voted it a "10."  Meets the challenge and is technically excellent.  I also find this photo humurous, brings a smile to my face everytime I look at it. ', '2005-12-13 18:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1974049, 206033, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very sharp image.   I like the shadows created by the slightly lifted feathers.</td>', 'Very sharp image.   I like the shadows created by the slightly lifted feathers.', '2005-12-23 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1976229, 203754, 31606, '<td valign="top">I see you had to wade through swamp to get this shot.  The feather is a nice touch.  The one thing that bothers me is the shadows.  But you can choose the time of day you want to shoot these kind of shots.  Did you get that close or did you zoom in the whole 10X?  Either way is is a nice shot with great focus where it needs to be.  I think if you play with the contrast a little you might dull some of those shadows.</td>', 'I see you had to wade through swamp to get this shot.  The feather is a nice touch.  The one thing that bothers me is the shadows.  But you can choose the time of day you want to shoot these kind of shots.  Did you get that close or did you zoom in the whole 10X?  Either way is is a nice shot with great focus where it needs to be.  I think if you play with the contrast a little you might dull some of those shadows.', '2005-12-24 19:46:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2014515, 206284, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5.  I thought the texture capture was fairly good but, ''criticism''; if it was either more on an angle, or ''straightened'', plus more space around and possibly even a different, more complementary ''base''/background, would likely have given this something extra and made it better in my opinion.  The top right on the egg has some ''blown''/overexposed issues, but difficult to control - perhaps a variation in lighting may have helped.</td>', 'I gave this a 5.  I thought the texture capture was fairly good but, ''criticism''; if it was either more on an angle, or ''straightened'', plus more space around and possibly even a different, more complementary ''base''/background, would likely have given this something extra and made it better in my opinion.  The top right on the egg has some ''blown''/overexposed issues, but difficult to control - perhaps a variation in lighting may have helped.', '2006-01-08 07:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2091404, 204993, 48471, '<td valign="top">Why such a wide border? Why the border in the first place? Great photo.</td>', 'Why such a wide border? Why the border in the first place? Great photo.', '2006-01-27 07:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2129087, 206468, 29156, '<td valign="top">the reason why this is one of the best:<br/>perfect grayscale, so many gray tones and clarity in the wood, not unlike Ansel Adams photos,<br/>the barbed wire adds an interest to it and the composition is good,<br/>the focus is good and the blurred background, the frame fits perfectly and adds to the image so you enjoy the gray tones even better</td>', 'the reason why this is one of the best:perfect grayscale, so many gray tones and clarity in the wood, not unlike Ansel Adams photos,the barbed wire adds an interest to it and the composition is good,the focus is good and the blurred background, the frame fits perfectly and adds to the image so you enjoy the gray tones even better', '2006-02-07 08:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2130674, 206468, 42013, '<td valign="top">Interesting, just read your "six months later" comments.  As a Christian, the title certainly catches my attention.  but, that being said, I think you did such a good job with the exposure, the textures of steel and wood, along with the composition that it is a compelling image to me regardless of the title.  IMO, it could have called "caught" or "circles" or whatever and the image would speak for itself.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting, just read your "six months later" comments.  As a Christian, the title certainly catches my attention.  but, that being said, I think you did such a good job with the exposure, the textures of steel and wood, along with the composition that it is a compelling image to me regardless of the title.  IMO, it could have called "caught" or "circles" or whatever and the image would speak for itself.  Good job.', '2006-02-07 19:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2261742, 204162, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a grinner.  rediculously underappreciated.  oh well...</td>', 'this is a grinner.  rediculously underappreciated.  oh well...', '2006-03-27 01:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
